WEBVTT

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.960
'Amaya, I am suspending you
for a month.'

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.790
'Come back after
your leg gets better.'

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:06.630
'If I become the CEO,
we can be one team.'

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:08.930
'Hereafter, if you
talk to me like this'

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:11.050
'you will see the Radhi
that I have become.'

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:15.290
'Who all think that Mr. Preetham
shouldn't work in this hospital?'

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.730
'Somewhere deep inside, I feel that
this hospital will function better'

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.590
'if an experienced person
takes up this position.'

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.070
'Don't take everything all at once.
Sort it out one by one.'

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.330
'After many years,
Vijay and I met each other.'

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:33.380
'He asked about me.
He asked about my marriage.'

00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:38.710
'But till now, he has not
asked anything about Reena.'

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.210
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:01:02.230 --> 00:01:04.690
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:10.270
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:01:11.950 --> 00:01:14.270
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.930
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:19.530
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:22.290
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:27.320
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:32.360
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:38.710
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:12.800
Hello.

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:16.510
Radhi.

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:19.960
What happened?

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:23.000
'Radhi.'

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:27.960
Vijay, our house has never
been so quiet all these days.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:32.280
I have never felt so lonely.

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:33.560
Where is your dad?

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:37.340
Dad left in the morning
because he had some work.

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:43.310
From waking up in the morning
and cooking to packing it for school,

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:45.820
my mom takes care of everything.

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:49.840
'Mom was always with me.'

00:02:50.930 --> 00:02:52.080
But now..

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:57.290
I don't know what to do.

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:00.290
I don't even know how to cook.

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:04.840
I am hungry, Vijay.

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:09.610
Don't cry, Radhi.
I'll be there.

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:19.150
Where is the kitchen?

00:03:19.650 --> 00:03:20.960
Do you know how to cook?

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:23.840
I didn't know how to,
till the minute you called me.

00:03:24.200 --> 00:03:25.160
Come, let's see.

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:45.370
Eat.

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:17.480
Hi, Radhi.

00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:19.530
What do you want?

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:21.470
Looks like you'd hit me.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:23.640
I have brought something for you.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:25.800
I've already eaten.

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:27.810
You would have already eaten.

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:29.200
You would have even brought lunch.

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:31.370
But if you know
what's in this lunch box,

00:04:31.770 --> 00:04:33.500
you would definitely
want to taste it.

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.440
What?

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:35.920
Upma.

00:04:38.020 --> 00:04:40.320
Do you remember?
Once, when your dad wasn't home

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:41.910
you called me
and said you were hungry.

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.580
I came over to your place
and made upma for you.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:45.110
You don't even like upma

00:04:45.370 --> 00:04:48.130
but you enjoyed it
and praised me too.

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:50.330
Shall I tell you something?

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:51.450
Sure.

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:53.550
I didn't like the upma
you made that day.

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:55.880
Really?

00:04:56.130 --> 00:04:58.650
You said you liked it then,
but now you're denying it.

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:01.000
I lied so that you don't feel bad.

00:05:02.880 --> 00:05:03.790
Is that so?

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.950
I had so much confidence
after you praised me.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.750
I started cooking upma
for everyone at home.

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:14.770
I have also enjoyed
cooking upma for myself.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:21.250
Anyway, we used to have 'Egg Puffs'
at school around this time.

00:05:21.610 --> 00:05:23.370
You like it hot, right?

00:05:23.620 --> 00:05:26.340
After class, Tilak, you and me
would start running..

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:27.550
Stop it, Vijay!

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:30.010
What are you trying to say?

00:05:30.210 --> 00:05:31.420
Why are you bringing up all this?

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:34.080
A lot of things
have happened in our past.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:35.900
But there were so many
beautiful things too.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:40.040
Those beautiful things gave me
a lot of pain, at one point in time.

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:43.380
Don't try to make me angry
by mentioning that, Vijay.

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:45.130
Yeah.

00:05:46.020 --> 00:05:47.460
Let me ask you one thing.

00:05:48.560 --> 00:05:49.540
Look, Vijay.

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:51.640
If it's about work, tell me.

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:54.290
Else, I want you out of my office.

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:00.000
Let me make this clear.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:04.420
Don't disturb me like this.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:06.720
Otherwise, I have
to give a complaint

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:08.420
to the medical council
on disciplinary action.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:09.380
Radhi..

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:11.460
Don't think that I won't do it.

00:06:11.950 --> 00:06:13.080
You better don't disturb me.

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:16.410
Okay.

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:33.210
Hi, Grandpa.

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:35.490
Nothing. Have you
left for the hospital?

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:36.580
I'm eating.

00:06:37.020 --> 00:06:38.530
I still have time
to leave for the hospital.

00:06:38.770 --> 00:06:39.650
Is it?

00:06:39.890 --> 00:06:40.840
Okay.

00:06:41.630 --> 00:06:42.960
Do you do math?

00:06:43.830 --> 00:06:45.580
Did I become a doctor
without doing math?

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:51.030
Can you come to our house?

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.060
Our house?

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:53.180
Your house.

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:54.340
Your daughter's house.

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:55.570
Yes, dear.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.000
Come here.

00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:58.030
'Why?'

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:02.000
Divi is struggling
to solve a problem.

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:04.630
Me too, Grandpa.

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:06.130
I can see that.

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:09.670
Divi has a math exam tomorrow.

00:07:09.850 --> 00:07:11.070
She has some doubts.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:13.590
She asked me, but I didn't know.
- 'So?'

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:16.380
You have studied math.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:18.080
Come and solve it.

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:19.540
No, I won't come.

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:21.810
If your daughter comes
to know, we'll be in trouble.

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:24.000
Radhi has left for the hospital.

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:27.020
I won't come.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:28.680
Come on, dear.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.250
Help this old man out.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:34.030
Fine, I'll come.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:40.630
Hi, Grandpa.

00:07:40.970 --> 00:07:42.060
Hi, Reena.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:43.000
Hi, dude.

00:07:43.380 --> 00:07:44.260
Hi.

00:07:45.680 --> 00:07:46.710
What's your problem?

00:07:46.880 --> 00:07:49.080
I've been trying for a long time
to solve this problem.

00:07:49.170 --> 00:07:50.790
But I'm not getting the answer.

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:51.970
Is this your problem?

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:53.770
See how I solve it now, give me.

00:08:04.710 --> 00:08:05.580
See now.

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:08.500
The answer is wrong.

00:08:08.960 --> 00:08:09.860
Is it wrong?

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:12.250
Yes, I did have a doubt
while solving it.

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:13.630
Give it to me now.

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:18.140
This one?

00:08:19.590 --> 00:08:20.830
This is also wrong.

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:22.920
Is it wrong?

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:27.080
Not that, it's this one.

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:37.670
You're using the wrong method.

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:39.250
Wrong method?

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:40.670
This is math, right?

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:45.530
Dude, you're not teaching Divi.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:47.320
It looks like Divi is teaching you.

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:52.090
If you know the method and
the answer, why did you call me?

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:55.540
Grandpa, look at how
she makes up excuses.

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:58.770
It's been a long time
since I had to do math.

00:08:59.170 --> 00:09:02.540
I'll get it
if I try to recall it online.

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:04.630
No need for that, give me.
- Wait.

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:07.980
I thought at least
you'd teach me properly.

00:09:08.050 --> 00:09:09.060
But I was wrong.

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:11.420
Grandpa, please send her back home.

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:15.290
Hey, she came to help you, right?

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:20.090
I was trying to solve a problem.
But I'm facing another problem.

00:09:20.140 --> 00:09:22.170
Hey, who are you
calling a problem?

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:24.630
The math problem.
- No, you meant me.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.600
You knew it, right?
Then why did you ask?

00:09:27.400 --> 00:09:28.460
Hey, Sid, come on.

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:31.010
She will make us forget everything
in the name of teaching us.

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:32.500
Bye, dude.

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:35.380
Grandpa.

00:09:35.430 --> 00:09:38.040
Did you call me to humiliate me
in front of these brats?

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:39.030
Dear.

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:42.830
She's a kid, forget it.
- Is she a kid?

00:09:43.020 --> 00:09:45.210
Here, have some snacks.

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:52.340
How's everything
going on at the hospital?

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:54.710
It's going on as usual.

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:58.700
Is everyone talking
to you normally?

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:01.040
Everyone is friendly.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.340
Okay, very nice.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:05.000
I heard there's a new doctor.

00:10:05.120 --> 00:10:06.040
He is..

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.590
Dr. Vijay?
- Yes.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:09.000
He talks well.

00:10:09.180 --> 00:10:11.540
Oh, are you working under him?

00:10:11.820 --> 00:10:12.750
No, Grandpa.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:14.250
Since there's no chief doctor,

00:10:14.490 --> 00:10:16.590
no one has been
allotted to work under him.

00:10:17.130 --> 00:10:18.130
Oh.

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:20.960
Why are you asking?

00:10:21.790 --> 00:10:26.290
No, Radhi was telling me
that he is rude to everyone.

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:27.250
That's why I asked.

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:28.460
Grandpa.

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:30.380
Have you met Dr. Radhi?

00:10:33.140 --> 00:10:33.960
Okay.

00:10:34.060 --> 00:10:36.040
Be careful with that doctor.

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:37.510
I'll take care of it.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.380
Don't ask me to do math anymore.

00:10:39.590 --> 00:10:40.750
I have work, I'll leave.

00:10:41.160 --> 00:10:42.000
Bye.

00:10:47.420 --> 00:10:49.040
Hello, sir.
- Hi, Manasa.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.000
We usually have our sessions
in the morning, right?

00:10:51.340 --> 00:10:52.710
We can do it here, Manasa.

00:10:53.760 --> 00:10:55.420
You said no one should know.

00:10:55.790 --> 00:10:56.750
I'll take care of it.

00:10:58.510 --> 00:10:59.380
Okay.

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:02.380
I have a question before
we start the session.

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:04.340
Before and after counselling

00:11:04.550 --> 00:11:06.130
do you feel any difference?

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:09.130
To be honest, I do feel better.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:10.290
Good.

00:11:11.860 --> 00:11:14.920
So we're on the right track.

00:11:16.390 --> 00:11:19.730
Did you go out as I said
in the last session?

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.250
Or did you meet anyone?

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.420
That's nice, Arjun.

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:30.560
I dropped Reena at home yesterday.

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.000
What did I tell you
in the last session?

00:11:40.450 --> 00:11:41.420
I remember.

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.380
But I can't stay away
from Reena, Manasa.

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:51.500
Okay, what did she say?

00:11:55.880 --> 00:12:00.670
Arjun, I can help you only
if you talk to me openly.

00:12:01.790 --> 00:12:03.380
There's a lot on my mind, Manasa.

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:08.340
I feel confused.

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:15.650
And.. I'm thinking of stepping
down from the post of CEO.

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:19.690
That's what I was
discussing with Reena.

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:21.710
Oh.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.340
What did she say about that?

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.620
She asked me to take my time,

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:34.540
and discuss it
with experienced people.

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:37.880
She asked me to figure
out everything one by one.

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:41.880
She said everything will be solved.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.090
Why are you laughing?

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:50.040
After discussing everything,

00:12:52.230 --> 00:12:54.150
she hugged me before leaving.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:57.920
That hug didn't feel
normal to me, Manasa.

00:13:00.700 --> 00:13:03.650
It felt like I got everything back.

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:09.000
That hug felt like
she was there for me.

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:11.640
Arjun.

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:16.920
You're taking the things that Reena
does casually, as signs of hope.

00:13:17.890 --> 00:13:21.130
And when you approach
her with that hope,

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:23.250
if she happens to hurt you

00:13:23.420 --> 00:13:25.790
or break your expectations,

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:31.210
you're drinking to escape
from those expectations.

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.380
I feel like everything
is going well, Manasa.

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.360
You'd feel like that
every time, Arjun.

00:13:37.740 --> 00:13:39.340
Because that's what you want.

00:13:39.890 --> 00:13:40.750
Trust me.

00:13:40.930 --> 00:13:43.040
Try maintaining
a detachment from Reena.

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:44.920
You'll find a big difference.

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:48.840
How can I be detached from
the person I love, Manasa?

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:50.000
Hi, Arjun.

00:13:53.580 --> 00:13:55.460
Okay, I'll come later.
- Reena, it's okay.

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:57.410
Come.

00:13:59.860 --> 00:14:00.710
Manasa.

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:03.250
Okay, Arjun.

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:11.420
What's up, ma'am?

00:14:12.010 --> 00:14:13.250
You have come to see me.

00:14:13.630 --> 00:14:14.530
Why, sir?

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.420
Haven't I come
looking for you before?

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:20.760
You told me about your
resignation yesterday.

00:14:20.990 --> 00:14:22.390
What have you decided about that?

00:14:23.600 --> 00:14:25.000
I haven't decided yet, Reena.

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:27.290
I don't know how
people will react if I tell them.

00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:30.210
And on the other side,
I need to prepare myself mentally.

00:14:33.960 --> 00:14:34.880
Then?

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:37.170
What is Manasa doing here?

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:41.790
That's..
Just work stuff.

00:14:43.170 --> 00:14:45.830
There is no chief doctor.
So she's reporting to me.

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.260
Even when there was a chief doctor

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.710
I heard she has been
talking to the CEO.

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:51.540
I heard you've been
meeting her in the car.

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:56.380
That's..

00:14:57.310 --> 00:15:00.310
S-Something confidential.

00:15:02.360 --> 00:15:03.500
And Reena..

00:15:06.500 --> 00:15:09.040
I'm still thinking about
what happened yesterday.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:11.400
That hug.

00:15:13.590 --> 00:15:14.590
It felt so good.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:17.630
It was just a hug, right?
What's the big deal?

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:20.290
If it's given by someone you like.

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:22.590
How can it be just a hug?

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:24.750
Oh, like that?

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.800
Yes, like that.

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:32.250
If it cheered you up,
then so be it.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:35.040
That hug was my gift to you.

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:39.020
I like gifts like this.

00:15:40.560 --> 00:15:42.340
Nice.
- Excuse me, sir.

00:15:43.120 --> 00:15:45.090
The accounts team asked me
to give you the files, sir.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.710
Okay, I have some work too.

00:15:49.010 --> 00:15:50.980
See you later.
- Okay.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:02.900
Teju.

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:05.920
These are the files and subsequent
records of the patients I treated.

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:07.040
Check them.

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:09.670
Why are you giving this to me now?

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:12.760
I was reporting to Dr. Preetham.

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:13.760
He's not here now.

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:14.880
So..

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.220
Check it once
and give it to Dr. Radhi.

00:16:17.940 --> 00:16:18.850
Hey!

00:16:19.260 --> 00:16:21.380
Why don't you give this
to Dr. Radhi directly?

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:23.040
I can.

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:25.210
But it won't be the same.

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:34.630
Teju.

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:36.570
Tell me.

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:38.920
You're thinking
about everyone here.

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:41.250
You're thinking about
what everyone thinks.

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:43.960
You're thinking about the
problems between everyone.

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:46.540
Tell me the matter.

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:51.860
Do you know what's on my mind?

00:16:53.090 --> 00:16:54.840
I don't know.
- Why?

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:56.460
Because you're not that smart.

00:16:57.310 --> 00:16:58.290
And moreover..

00:16:59.020 --> 00:17:01.880
You're not so important in my life.
- Oh!

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:04.750
They're important, but
I'm not important to you.

00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:06.210
Am I right?
- Yes.

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:10.640
Then why are you telling me
everything, even your plans?

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:12.710
Because you're a fool.

00:17:13.660 --> 00:17:15.670
If I tell you something,
it won't get out.

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:16.710
That's why.

00:17:16.790 --> 00:17:19.250
Teju, do you really not know?

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:21.710
What should I know?

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:25.550
Teju.

00:17:25.800 --> 00:17:27.380
I like you.

00:17:28.090 --> 00:17:29.210
So?
- Hey!

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:32.720
What do you mean?

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:34.040
I just like you.

00:17:39.210 --> 00:17:41.090
Teju, I know that you know this.

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:48.400
You're good at pretending
that you don't know something.

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:51.510
Naveen.

00:17:53.810 --> 00:17:55.090
I have a lot of work.

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:57.290
I don't have time for this.

00:17:58.730 --> 00:18:00.130
Teju, I'm serious..

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:01.130
Please.

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:04.090
I'm not in a situation
to trust anyone.

00:18:04.530 --> 00:18:06.630
You have already done
the damage you could.

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:08.210
I have to take care of myself.

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:09.710
Do you understand?

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:18.580
Why are you talking
like this, Teju?

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:21.990
You like me, right?

00:18:23.410 --> 00:18:24.790
I'm very happy.

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:36.630
Naveen.

00:18:38.740 --> 00:18:39.830
I like you too.

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:41.420
I won't lie that I don't like you.

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:45.350
But others don't have
any complications like you.

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:47.590
First, try to sort it out.

00:18:51.630 --> 00:18:54.460
You just told me something
that makes me really happy.

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:56.880
And you immediately followed it up
by saying something that ruined it.

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:01.750
Don't worry.

00:19:01.890 --> 00:19:03.420
You'll get a good girl.

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:04.960
I don't care about that.

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:06.880
A good girl will
make my life boring.

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:10.840
A girl like you
will make my life adventurous.

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:13.210
So, you're saying
that I'm a bad girl?

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:14.460
Hey!

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:17.630
Why do you keep
putting me on the spot?

00:19:17.710 --> 00:19:18.630
Get lost.

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:19.840
Go and do your work.

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:22.040
You always say this.

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:32.340
Please save him, Doctor.

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:33.790
Shift him fast.
- Open your eyes!

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:38.550
It seems like a cardiac arrest.
Get the loading dose. - Okay.

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:40.100
Go and get the OT mask.

00:19:41.770 --> 00:19:43.480
We have to start the CPR, Nurse.

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:49.400
Fast!

00:19:57.420 --> 00:19:58.380
Move.

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:12.910
Nurse, turn him.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:17.860
Nurse, it looks like pulmonary oedema.
- Doctor?

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.830
Ask the patient to be shifted
to the cath lab immediately.

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:21.430
Inform the tech staff in the room.

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:23.750
Also, inform Reena, okay?
- Okay, Doctor.

00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:28.460
What happened?
- There is an ER patient.

00:20:28.560 --> 00:20:30.310
We thought it was an MI.
But we found out

00:20:30.380 --> 00:20:32.210
that it was pulmonary
oedema after doing CPR.

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:34.790
They've taken him to the cath lab.

00:20:35.390 --> 00:20:38.210
She isn't working in the ER today.
They've assigned me.

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:40.520
How can she proceed
without my permission?

00:20:40.620 --> 00:20:42.130
It's an emergency, Doctor.

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:43.750
She should've informed me.

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:45.130
It happened just now.

00:20:51.700 --> 00:20:52.910
Amaya or Abhinaya?

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:54.530
Amaya, ma'am.

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:57.340
I had a lot of hope
and trust in you, Amaya.

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:00.400
How can I trust you
after what happened?

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:01.670
Ma'am, I'm sorry.

00:21:01.800 --> 00:21:04.170
It won't happen again.
- I don't trust you, Amaya.

00:21:05.020 --> 00:21:08.570
You won't get any cases from my side.
Don't take them either, got it?

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:11.130
Ma'am, I'm really sorry.

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:14.260
I can't accept your apology.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:19.030
You can assist me
only after you gain my trust back.

00:21:21.030 --> 00:21:23.290
And never get involved
in my cases, got it?

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:25.160
Okay, ma'am.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:27.210
Amaya.
- Sir.

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:28.760
How's your leg now?

00:21:29.040 --> 00:21:29.960
It's fine, sir.

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:32.880
You're coming back now
after that problem, right?

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:34.800
Are you feeling bad?

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:36.630
What I did was wrong, sir.

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:38.500
Who doesn't make mistakes?

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:40.670
Life is full of ups and downs.
Everything will pass.

00:21:41.760 --> 00:21:44.370
Amaya, do one thing.
Will you assist me?

00:21:47.020 --> 00:21:47.830
Sir..

00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:49.660
Why? Won't you do it?

00:21:50.230 --> 00:21:51.260
It's not like that, sir.

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:52.460
It's not like that, right?

00:21:52.940 --> 00:21:55.090
Then, report to me with your work.

00:21:55.320 --> 00:21:56.170
I'll take care of it.

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:57.840
Okay, sir.

00:21:58.650 --> 00:21:59.690
Smile, Amaya.

00:22:27.510 --> 00:22:28.350
Ma'am.

00:22:29.060 --> 00:22:31.040
You know the situation
of the hospital very well.

00:22:32.890 --> 00:22:36.580
The major chaos here is due to
the absence of the chief doctor.

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:39.500
Yes, Arjun.
I, too, wanted to tell you.

00:22:39.690 --> 00:22:42.330
It's difficult to take
major decisions now.

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:44.750
I know, ma'am.

00:22:45.870 --> 00:22:49.860
I have a temporary solution.

00:22:50.370 --> 00:22:51.270
What's that?

00:22:55.710 --> 00:22:59.360
I think it'll be
better if you handle everything

00:22:59.550 --> 00:23:02.380
as a chief doctor for a few days.

00:23:02.550 --> 00:23:05.090
No, Arjun.
I told you when I rejoined here.

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:07.110
I don't want any post.

00:23:08.180 --> 00:23:09.040
Ma'am.

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:13.170
You know how difficult it is to run
this hospital without a chief doctor.

00:23:13.640 --> 00:23:16.790
And I'm trying to hire
a chief doctor from my end.

00:23:18.210 --> 00:23:22.840
So until then,
I need someone in this position.

00:23:24.400 --> 00:23:25.830
Hire someone temporarily.

00:23:29.180 --> 00:23:32.670
Ma'am, it's not that
I didn't think about it.

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:36.370
But if someone like
Dr. Preetham joins us

00:23:37.050 --> 00:23:39.960
and mess with the accounts,
it'll affect the hospital.

00:23:40.340 --> 00:23:43.640
I want someone whom
I can trust in this position.

00:23:46.050 --> 00:23:48.070
I've thought about it carefully.

00:23:49.760 --> 00:23:51.950
For the sake of the hospital.
Please, ma'am.

00:23:59.740 --> 00:24:00.970
I need some time to think.

00:24:05.540 --> 00:24:06.400
Sure, ma'am.

00:24:07.150 --> 00:24:08.080
Okay.

00:24:09.800 --> 00:24:11.750
Sir.
- Yeah, come in.

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:16.890
Sir, Dr. Radhi asked me
to give this to you.

00:24:17.620 --> 00:24:20.000
Keep it there.
- Thank you, sir.

00:25:56.706 --> 00:25:59.676
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:26:01.776 --> 00:26:04.236
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:26:06.766 --> 00:26:09.766
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:26:11.496 --> 00:26:13.766
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:26:13.956 --> 00:26:16.396
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:26:16.496 --> 00:26:19.026
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:26:19.206 --> 00:26:21.816
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:26:24.136 --> 00:26:26.776
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:26:29.216 --> 00:26:31.936
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:26:33.966 --> 00:26:38.356
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:26:53.686 --> 00:26:56.226
Don't be like that.
Tell me what it is.

00:26:56.426 --> 00:26:57.926
Why are you asking
from the beginning?

00:26:58.826 --> 00:27:01.086
So, what do you want
to know about me?

00:27:03.126 --> 00:27:04.006
Generally.

00:27:04.936 --> 00:27:08.386
Where did you meet him first?
How did you fall in love?

00:27:13.046 --> 00:27:16.626
Vinod and I met
at a cultural event in school.

00:27:17.806 --> 00:27:19.326
Both of us were dancers.

00:27:19.976 --> 00:27:23.296
He praised my dance
and I praised his dance.

00:27:24.166 --> 00:27:27.126
Wait, did you fall in love
because of dance?

00:27:27.796 --> 00:27:29.216
I have also seen your dance.

00:27:29.736 --> 00:27:31.216
You are an average dancer.

00:27:31.656 --> 00:27:33.196
There is nothing
to fall in love with.

00:27:33.656 --> 00:27:34.486
Hey.

00:27:35.276 --> 00:27:36.636
Okay, tell me more.

00:27:39.766 --> 00:27:42.276
When I met him,

00:27:42.466 --> 00:27:44.166
I felt a closeness with him.

00:27:45.006 --> 00:27:49.296
I felt it getting deeper
the more I spoke to him.

00:27:51.136 --> 00:27:52.996
Eventually, we ended up
falling for each other.

00:27:53.336 --> 00:27:54.296
How was Vinod?

00:27:54.436 --> 00:27:55.296
What do you mean?

00:27:55.586 --> 00:27:57.546
What kind of a guy was he?

00:28:01.046 --> 00:28:03.466
I don't know
how to tell you specifically.

00:28:05.256 --> 00:28:06.926
We used to have little fights.

00:28:07.076 --> 00:28:08.796
It would even become a huge fight.

00:28:09.466 --> 00:28:15.046
But the very next day, he'd talk
to me as if nothing happened

00:28:15.246 --> 00:28:16.406
without any attitude.

00:28:17.956 --> 00:28:20.706
That's the quality
I liked in Vinod.

00:28:22.626 --> 00:28:25.426
You're a girl who talks
like a mad person.

00:28:26.526 --> 00:28:28.926
I am totally surprised
by this side of you.

00:28:31.026 --> 00:28:32.836
Okay, tell me more.

00:28:37.186 --> 00:28:38.506
Everything was going well.

00:28:39.986 --> 00:28:41.126
We went to college.

00:28:42.626 --> 00:28:44.126
My friends were his friends.

00:28:44.636 --> 00:28:45.966
His friends were my friends.

00:28:47.206 --> 00:28:50.626
It was the life I dreamt of.

00:28:52.446 --> 00:28:53.296
It was like that.

00:28:55.276 --> 00:28:57.716
When I was in my
second year of college,

00:28:59.936 --> 00:29:00.876
there was an accident.

00:29:01.786 --> 00:29:02.786
What do you mean?

00:29:04.336 --> 00:29:05.876
He died in an accident.

00:29:14.056 --> 00:29:15.066
Three years, right?

00:29:18.096 --> 00:29:20.016
But you didn't show
the pain to anyone.

00:29:21.226 --> 00:29:22.046
Why?

00:29:23.506 --> 00:29:25.046
Vinod didn't like it
when I was sad.

00:29:26.766 --> 00:29:29.086
He'd always tell me that
my smile shouldn't fade.

00:29:39.786 --> 00:29:40.586
Nilofer.

00:29:41.506 --> 00:29:42.756
May I ask you one more thing?

00:29:44.176 --> 00:29:46.426
What did you and Vinod
talk about last?

00:29:56.566 --> 00:29:57.666
Hey, Nilofer.

00:29:58.336 --> 00:29:59.206
I am sorry.

00:29:59.296 --> 00:30:00.506
I just asked out of curiosity.

00:30:00.796 --> 00:30:02.626
If you can't say it, it's okay.

00:30:14.586 --> 00:30:17.006
When Vinod and I were in college,

00:30:18.836 --> 00:30:20.716
we threw a party
for a friend's birthday.

00:30:23.316 --> 00:30:27.216
We had planned
to go there together.

00:30:28.806 --> 00:30:29.876
But in the last minute,

00:30:32.346 --> 00:30:36.666
he couldn't come because the
professor had given him some work.

00:30:38.006 --> 00:30:39.406
I went there first.

00:30:44.086 --> 00:30:46.376
My father called me that day

00:30:47.436 --> 00:30:50.146
and asked me to come home soon.

00:30:53.316 --> 00:30:54.806
I called him and asked,

00:30:56.126 --> 00:30:57.626
when he'd be coming

00:30:59.296 --> 00:31:00.416
since my dad had called me home.

00:31:08.536 --> 00:31:09.466
He replied..

00:31:10.716 --> 00:31:13.756
"Nilofer, it doesn't matter
how late it gets."

00:31:15.006 --> 00:31:16.546
"Wait for me."

00:31:18.256 --> 00:31:19.666
"I'll be there."

00:31:25.336 --> 00:31:26.916
That was the last time
I spoke to him.

00:31:32.066 --> 00:31:33.856
I waited for him for a long time.

00:31:37.236 --> 00:31:38.466
But he didn't come.

00:31:48.176 --> 00:31:49.166
Hey, Nilofer.

00:31:50.486 --> 00:31:51.466
I am sorry.

00:31:53.586 --> 00:31:55.086
Let's not talk about this anymore.

00:31:57.726 --> 00:31:58.876
We came here to shop.

00:31:59.636 --> 00:32:01.166
Come, let's do that.

00:32:02.916 --> 00:32:03.756
Come on.

00:32:09.816 --> 00:32:10.666
Okay.

00:32:11.226 --> 00:32:12.256
What are we doing here?

00:32:12.516 --> 00:32:13.886
Are you buying
shirts for your father?

00:32:14.176 --> 00:32:14.966
No.

00:32:15.386 --> 00:32:16.246
Then?

00:32:16.586 --> 00:32:17.796
How is this shirt?

00:32:18.516 --> 00:32:19.966
Oh.

00:32:20.186 --> 00:32:22.126
You have found a new boyfriend.

00:32:22.756 --> 00:32:23.626
You fool.

00:32:24.406 --> 00:32:25.786
Your birthday is next week.

00:32:26.046 --> 00:32:27.796
Oh, is it for me?

00:32:27.956 --> 00:32:28.786
Yes.

00:32:29.916 --> 00:32:33.716
I thought you wouldn't buy me
anything since you're angry with me.

00:32:34.716 --> 00:32:35.626
Not bad.

00:32:37.896 --> 00:32:39.006
Do you like the shirt?

00:32:44.096 --> 00:32:45.336
It's just Rs. 700.

00:32:45.676 --> 00:32:47.586
There are better shirts
for Rs. 1,500.

00:32:48.076 --> 00:32:48.986
Shall we go there?

00:32:50.296 --> 00:32:51.126
Go.

00:32:51.696 --> 00:32:52.756
Thank you, Nilofer.

00:32:53.976 --> 00:32:55.086
Happy birthday to me.

00:32:57.446 --> 00:33:00.136
I have apologised to you
for more than a million times.

00:33:00.486 --> 00:33:03.216
But I still don't know
why I am apologising.

00:33:03.346 --> 00:33:04.716
What is the problem?

00:33:04.966 --> 00:33:08.246
Everyone here is saying
bad things about you.

00:33:08.546 --> 00:33:11.166
That doesn't mean that I am wrong.

00:33:11.546 --> 00:33:15.376
I might have mocked them
and they did it to get back at me.

00:33:15.506 --> 00:33:17.086
Because they love me a lot.

00:33:17.256 --> 00:33:20.196
But still,
they are complaining about you.

00:33:20.256 --> 00:33:21.756
My tongue is the problem.

00:33:23.676 --> 00:33:26.636
There is a saying, "Tell me about
your friend, I'll say who you are."

00:33:27.166 --> 00:33:29.036
Ask my friend, Reena.

00:33:29.136 --> 00:33:31.756
Don't you have any male friends?

00:33:32.466 --> 00:33:33.466
I wish.

00:33:33.586 --> 00:33:37.666
But in all friend groups, the girls
would be friends with a good guy.

00:33:37.916 --> 00:33:39.296
I am that good guy.

00:33:39.616 --> 00:33:41.406
You are not serious about anything.

00:33:41.646 --> 00:33:44.216
I should blame myself
for talking to you.

00:33:44.506 --> 00:33:45.626
Charu..

00:33:45.686 --> 00:33:47.076
Please sit down.

00:33:47.296 --> 00:33:48.216
Sorry.

00:33:49.246 --> 00:33:50.216
Tell me what it is.

00:33:51.726 --> 00:33:53.586
My family is asking me
to get married.

00:33:53.816 --> 00:33:55.296
Super, tell me when.

00:33:55.336 --> 00:33:57.256
I'll ask my parents to meet yours.
- No.

00:33:57.376 --> 00:34:00.256
Why not? Everyone
in your family likes me.

00:34:00.486 --> 00:34:02.336
The cinema doctor likes me so much.

00:34:02.826 --> 00:34:03.736
You are right.

00:34:03.836 --> 00:34:06.826
But I'm wondering
why I should marry you.

00:34:06.976 --> 00:34:07.796
Oh.

00:34:07.976 --> 00:34:11.466
Even the patients in this hospital
are waiting for a groom like Rocky.

00:34:11.886 --> 00:34:12.976
What is your problem?

00:34:16.586 --> 00:34:17.416
Look here.

00:34:17.686 --> 00:34:20.216
I am not flirting with girls
like they said.

00:34:20.606 --> 00:34:23.656
I've been true to our relationship.
- Okay, I believe you.

00:34:23.956 --> 00:34:25.006
Good girl.

00:34:25.436 --> 00:34:26.296
Give me your phone.

00:34:28.416 --> 00:34:29.376
Why?

00:34:29.696 --> 00:34:32.256
You are being true, right?
Give it to me, I will check.

00:34:32.916 --> 00:34:33.966
No.

00:34:34.406 --> 00:34:35.756
Are you hiding something?

00:34:36.086 --> 00:34:37.296
N-No.

00:34:38.236 --> 00:34:42.256
Don't even think
about making up excuses.

00:34:42.336 --> 00:34:43.466
Give me your phone.

00:34:43.556 --> 00:34:44.626
Otherwise, I will leave.

00:34:53.656 --> 00:34:54.586
Just a minute.

00:34:55.146 --> 00:34:56.396
Yes, tell me.

00:34:57.786 --> 00:34:59.586
An emergency?
Should I come?

00:35:00.286 --> 00:35:01.546
I will be right there..

00:35:01.626 --> 00:35:03.966
He called you
because you told him to. - Charu.

00:35:04.026 --> 00:35:06.566
We are busy,
you get home safe, bye.. - Hey!

00:35:11.536 --> 00:35:12.446
Amaya.

00:35:13.206 --> 00:35:14.476
You came to work?

00:35:14.666 --> 00:35:16.586
You didn't tell me.
When did you come?

00:35:16.716 --> 00:35:19.046
My leg is better now..

00:35:19.546 --> 00:35:20.906
I thought I could work.

00:35:20.996 --> 00:35:23.086
So, I asked Mr. Arjun.

00:35:23.166 --> 00:35:25.176
Good, who are you working under?

00:35:25.486 --> 00:35:28.086
Dr. Vijay.
- Oh, Dr. Vijay?

00:35:28.216 --> 00:35:30.796
But don't strain yourself.

00:35:30.886 --> 00:35:32.716
Your leg is not fully healed yet.

00:35:32.976 --> 00:35:34.756
If you need any help, ask me.

00:35:34.846 --> 00:35:36.226
No, I will take care.

00:35:36.376 --> 00:35:37.716
Okay, bye.

00:35:38.006 --> 00:35:38.886
Kamal.

00:35:39.106 --> 00:35:40.836
What?
- Just a minute.

00:35:46.316 --> 00:35:47.236
What is this?

00:35:47.526 --> 00:35:50.236
This is the money you gave Abhi
when you had come home.

00:35:50.436 --> 00:35:51.296
What is this?

00:35:51.816 --> 00:35:53.566
You keep it for your expenses.

00:35:53.656 --> 00:35:56.196
Give me after you get your salary.
What is the hurry?

00:35:56.286 --> 00:35:57.176
No, Kamal.

00:35:57.676 --> 00:36:00.016
It is not new for me
to face such situations.

00:36:00.426 --> 00:36:02.586
But now, I am scared.

00:36:03.506 --> 00:36:05.006
I don't want this money, Kamal.

00:36:06.086 --> 00:36:08.006
Amaya, you don't want
the money or me?

00:36:09.196 --> 00:36:10.836
I don't want either.

00:36:12.006 --> 00:36:13.306
What are you saying, Amaya?

00:36:14.636 --> 00:36:17.416
Who worries about separation
even before starting a relationship

00:36:17.746 --> 00:36:19.536
If you think like that,
you will get scared.

00:36:19.996 --> 00:36:22.376
I can understand if I think
from your point of view, Kamal.

00:36:22.796 --> 00:36:24.836
But think from my point of view.

00:36:25.446 --> 00:36:27.586
Don't talk to me about this again.

00:36:27.766 --> 00:36:31.006
I don't want your money
or you coming to my house.

00:36:31.396 --> 00:36:32.466
Please understand, Kamal.

00:36:33.526 --> 00:36:34.626
Amaya..

00:36:43.896 --> 00:36:45.696
Nilofer, I am okay
with this shirt for my birthday.

00:36:45.956 --> 00:36:48.376
But not only shirts,
I like cars and bikes too.

00:36:48.946 --> 00:36:50.466
Don't overreach.

00:36:50.756 --> 00:36:52.046
It is not wrong to ask.

00:36:54.846 --> 00:36:55.756
Senior.

00:36:58.636 --> 00:37:01.386
How is the pulmonary oedema
patient from yesterday?

00:37:02.716 --> 00:37:05.766
Yeah, we struggled to save him.

00:37:06.436 --> 00:37:08.356
His left side heart is very weak.

00:37:08.496 --> 00:37:11.626
So, it couldn't pump
the blood properly.

00:37:12.206 --> 00:37:15.006
Plus, there was fluid
accumulation in his lung.

00:37:15.896 --> 00:37:16.756
That's why.

00:37:17.506 --> 00:37:18.626
But he is stable now.

00:37:20.166 --> 00:37:22.046
I didn't ask you anything, senior.

00:37:23.176 --> 00:37:25.546
Reena, I didn't have duty
in the ER yesterday.

00:37:26.106 --> 00:37:29.256
I know that you questioned
the nurse for not informing you.

00:37:31.466 --> 00:37:33.176
I did ask her, senior.

00:37:34.206 --> 00:37:39.236
But in that situation, it was
right to prioritise the patient.

00:37:39.306 --> 00:37:40.536
I would have done the same.

00:37:40.936 --> 00:37:43.086
But you didn't have
to explain so much.

00:37:43.776 --> 00:37:45.986
I just inquired about the patient.

00:37:46.566 --> 00:37:47.546
Nothing else.

00:37:47.836 --> 00:37:48.716
Okay, Reena.

00:37:56.096 --> 00:37:58.256
Ask Aruna to come.
- Okay, sir.

00:38:05.416 --> 00:38:06.306
Hey.

00:38:07.666 --> 00:38:09.216
Why do you look so serious?

00:38:09.966 --> 00:38:11.666
It all started
with Patient Ganga's case.

00:38:11.896 --> 00:38:13.926
I saw that case as an opportunity.

00:38:14.336 --> 00:38:18.176
But from then until now,
Anitha sees me as an enemy.

00:38:18.446 --> 00:38:20.586
She is figuring out
everything, Reena.

00:38:21.376 --> 00:38:24.676
Her mind is messed up.
Give her some time to process.

00:38:24.816 --> 00:38:26.966
Once she gets better,
everything will be fine.

00:38:28.076 --> 00:38:29.546
Are you an advocate
for your friend?

00:38:32.186 --> 00:38:33.336
I didn't say anything.

00:38:36.966 --> 00:38:38.046
Dr. Kiran.

00:38:38.246 --> 00:38:40.486
Someone has come to see you.
They are waiting outside.

00:38:40.756 --> 00:38:41.586
Ask them to come in.

00:38:41.716 --> 00:38:44.106
Sir, they asked you to come to the
parking lot since it's an emergency.

00:38:45.246 --> 00:38:46.296
An emergency?

00:38:48.156 --> 00:38:49.376
Kiran, wait, I'll also come.

00:38:53.576 --> 00:38:54.876
Where are they going?

00:38:56.636 --> 00:38:57.836
It's the life of interns.

00:39:04.936 --> 00:39:06.576
Here?
- What happened, bro?

00:39:06.806 --> 00:39:07.996
What happened?
- Wait.

00:39:08.116 --> 00:39:09.126
Who are you?

00:39:09.226 --> 00:39:11.466
Just keep your mouth shut.
- What is this? - What's going on?

00:39:11.606 --> 00:39:13.376
Let go!
- Why are you fighting?

00:39:13.566 --> 00:39:16.956
You slapped me in front of a girl
at the police station the other day.

00:39:17.116 --> 00:39:18.826
You ran away before I could
bring my men. - Let go!

00:39:19.006 --> 00:39:20.856
What do you think of yourself?
- It's you? - Hey!

00:39:20.986 --> 00:39:23.206
Did you give him the address
after hitting him? - You idiot.

00:39:23.246 --> 00:39:26.626
Shut up.
- I've been searching for you.

00:39:27.126 --> 00:39:28.916
I didn't know
that you are a doctor.

00:39:29.126 --> 00:39:30.566
I saw you today by accident.

00:39:31.786 --> 00:39:33.716
Come on, hit me now.

00:39:34.146 --> 00:39:35.256
Hey, hit him.

00:39:35.546 --> 00:39:37.006
Hit him.
- Shut up. - Hey!

00:39:37.206 --> 00:39:39.426
There are three of us. Do you
think he can hit us and leave?

00:39:39.926 --> 00:39:41.546
I'll call the police.
- Give that to me. - Hey!

00:39:41.696 --> 00:39:43.676
Look here.
This is my workplace.

00:39:43.846 --> 00:39:45.926
Let us take it outside.
Leave me now.

00:39:46.346 --> 00:39:47.766
Yes, boss.
This is a hospital.

00:39:48.066 --> 00:39:49.936
You can take him outside and hit him.
- Hey..

00:39:50.016 --> 00:39:52.086
Why?
- I'm buying you time.

00:39:52.566 --> 00:39:54.276
He didn't consider this before
hitting me. - Quiet.

00:39:54.696 --> 00:39:58.276
He didn't even stop to think
that it was a police station.

00:39:58.776 --> 00:40:01.096
We've caught you now.

00:40:03.676 --> 00:40:04.546
No.

00:40:04.626 --> 00:40:05.626
Hey, Kiran!

00:40:11.086 --> 00:40:11.966
Hey..

00:40:15.626 --> 00:40:16.626
Let go.

00:40:17.966 --> 00:40:19.286
Take your hands off him.

00:40:19.386 --> 00:40:20.336
Let go of his hand.

00:40:21.226 --> 00:40:22.716
I'm talking to you.
- Let him go!

00:40:29.606 --> 00:40:30.846
Who are you?

00:40:31.436 --> 00:40:34.156
Don't interfere
unnecessarily, get lost.

00:40:34.356 --> 00:40:35.196
Hey.

00:40:35.636 --> 00:40:36.586
Who are you?

00:40:36.956 --> 00:40:39.976
You are trying to hit a doctor
after coming to a hospital. - Hey.

00:40:40.286 --> 00:40:41.796
He is the one who
started the problem.

00:40:43.936 --> 00:40:45.046
What is this?
- Sir.

00:40:45.166 --> 00:40:46.906
When Reena and I went to
the police station to get our bikes

00:40:46.996 --> 00:40:48.836
he spoke ill of her.
That's why I hit him.

00:40:50.636 --> 00:40:51.546
Hey.

00:40:52.956 --> 00:40:54.876
All three of you tried
to hold him back, right?

00:40:54.996 --> 00:40:56.616
Come now, there are two of them.

00:40:56.716 --> 00:40:58.046
Try to touch him now.

00:40:58.106 --> 00:40:59.006
I'm also here.

00:40:59.876 --> 00:41:01.046
You'll beat them, right?

00:41:27.976 --> 00:41:28.966
Okay.

00:41:29.116 --> 00:41:32.666
If you want to get admitted
in this hospital, come forward.

00:41:32.746 --> 00:41:34.746
I'm already
under a lot of pressure.

00:41:36.216 --> 00:41:38.676
With the problems that I have,
my hits won't be normal.

00:41:40.046 --> 00:41:41.296
It will be deadly.

00:41:45.596 --> 00:41:46.466
Come on.

00:41:48.686 --> 00:41:51.946
Hey, let's leave now. We'll take
care of him later. - Tell me.

00:41:52.276 --> 00:41:55.006
Let's deal with him later.
- This is not over yet.

00:41:55.676 --> 00:41:56.926
Come, let's go.

00:41:57.936 --> 00:42:00.756
Hey, where are you running off to?
Come back!

00:42:01.816 --> 00:42:02.636
Sir.

00:42:02.736 --> 00:42:05.116
What a timing, sir!
You saved us at the right time.

00:42:05.536 --> 00:42:06.756
Can you help me?

00:42:06.876 --> 00:42:08.446
I want to hit a person in my house.
- Hey!

00:42:08.546 --> 00:42:10.046
Keep quiet, Nilofer.

00:42:11.826 --> 00:42:12.746
Thank you, sir.

00:42:13.516 --> 00:42:16.616
I didn't expect you
to come to my help.

00:42:16.796 --> 00:42:18.296
If it's a problem for our doctors

00:42:18.676 --> 00:42:19.926
I won't keep quiet.

00:42:21.176 --> 00:42:25.096
Likewise, don't bring your
personal issues to the hospital.

00:42:25.376 --> 00:42:26.466
No..

00:42:26.576 --> 00:42:29.496
Actually, Kiran has been dealing
with a lot of fights every day.

00:42:29.596 --> 00:42:32.716
He was unfortunate today.
- Hey, shut up.

00:42:33.346 --> 00:42:37.016
Back in college, I've been
in more fights than you have.

00:42:37.396 --> 00:42:38.386
I've seen it too.

00:42:38.916 --> 00:42:41.256
But.. That's a phase of life.

00:42:42.026 --> 00:42:43.906
You have to handle
everything after a certain age.

00:42:45.276 --> 00:42:48.836
Make sure that you don't bring
problems to the people around you.

00:42:49.276 --> 00:42:50.176
Sorry, sir.

00:42:50.596 --> 00:42:52.336
I'll make sure
that it doesn't happen again.

00:42:54.466 --> 00:42:55.346
Sir.

00:42:56.486 --> 00:42:57.336
I'm sorry.

00:42:58.296 --> 00:42:59.166
You've already said it.

00:42:59.426 --> 00:43:01.876
I went overboard with Reena.

00:43:02.376 --> 00:43:03.196
That's why.

00:43:04.126 --> 00:43:05.926
It's okay.
- I've realised one thing, sir.

00:43:06.426 --> 00:43:07.716
Reena still loves you.

00:43:08.506 --> 00:43:10.096
But she won't accept it.

00:43:12.936 --> 00:43:13.776
I know.

00:43:19.056 --> 00:43:22.626
Hey, you did all this
to tell Reena that you love her.

00:43:22.976 --> 00:43:24.586
What's wrong with that?
- You're right.

00:43:24.976 --> 00:43:28.046
But sometimes, I've done a lot
of things just to irritate him.

00:43:28.766 --> 00:43:31.046
When I think about it now,
I feel like it was wrong.

00:43:31.176 --> 00:43:33.546
He's our CEO.
He won't mind it, let's go.

00:43:45.336 --> 00:43:46.996
The patient's name is Sindu, Doctor.

00:43:47.096 --> 00:43:48.756
Bike accident,
she was driving without a helmet.

00:43:49.006 --> 00:43:50.786
Severe head injury
and ear bleeding.

00:43:56.186 --> 00:43:57.306
Her BP is dropping, Reena.

00:43:57.596 --> 00:43:58.936
We need to proceed to CT.

00:43:59.306 --> 00:44:01.366
We can't do CT without
stabilising the patient, Teju.

00:44:01.436 --> 00:44:02.906
There's a chance
of a crash in the scan.

00:44:02.996 --> 00:44:04.296
BP has crashed.
Pulse is also weak.

00:44:04.776 --> 00:44:05.656
Hey.

00:44:05.946 --> 00:44:06.946
It's a head trauma.

00:44:07.346 --> 00:44:08.816
We need to do it
before the brain bleeds.

00:44:08.896 --> 00:44:10.806
We can't do CT without
stabilising the patient, Teju.

00:44:10.956 --> 00:44:12.506
I think we should consult
a senior doctor.

00:44:12.696 --> 00:44:14.866
We don't have a chief doctor.
We need to ask Dr. Radhi.

00:44:16.036 --> 00:44:18.076
What's happening?
- Bike accident, sir.

00:44:18.196 --> 00:44:19.246
She was driving without a helmet.

00:44:19.356 --> 00:44:20.756
Severe head trauma
and ear bleeding.

00:44:20.856 --> 00:44:22.966
I'm suggesting doing CT
after stabilising the patient.

00:44:23.086 --> 00:44:24.706
Teju is suggesting
to do CT directly.

00:44:24.796 --> 00:44:26.776
And there's a chance
of brain bleeding.

00:44:26.836 --> 00:44:27.946
I don't know what to do now.

00:44:28.046 --> 00:44:29.846
Teju is right.
We need to do a CT immediately.

00:44:31.466 --> 00:44:33.296
She's so unstable, she'll collapse.

00:44:33.596 --> 00:44:35.306
What do we do
if it's an epidural bleed?

00:44:35.976 --> 00:44:38.036
We can't do CT without
intubating the patient, Vijay.

00:44:39.726 --> 00:44:40.576
Reena.

00:44:40.726 --> 00:44:44.856
Rush the fluids. Intubate the
patient and then shift to CT.

00:44:46.106 --> 00:44:49.426
We don't have time for that.
She needs to go to CT immediately.

00:44:49.566 --> 00:44:51.196
I've already handled
such situations.

00:44:51.296 --> 00:44:53.086
Of course, I've seen everything.

00:44:53.406 --> 00:44:55.586
But it's better
to stabilise the patient now.

00:44:55.986 --> 00:44:57.086
You can't take this decision.

00:44:57.376 --> 00:44:58.376
Why shouldn't I?

00:44:58.706 --> 00:44:59.966
Well, you're not the chief doctor.

00:45:03.296 --> 00:45:05.216
Reena and Teju, do as I say.

00:45:06.546 --> 00:45:08.066
I think she should go for CT.

00:45:08.426 --> 00:45:11.116
They can take this decision.
They're doctors, after all.

00:45:19.976 --> 00:45:22.436
Think about it as doctors
and take the right decision.

00:46:45.464 --> 00:46:48.494
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:46:50.544 --> 00:46:52.984
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:46:55.554 --> 00:46:58.374
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:47:00.224 --> 00:47:02.494
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:47:02.724 --> 00:47:05.194
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:47:05.264 --> 00:47:07.804
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:47:08.064 --> 00:47:10.514
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:47:12.944 --> 00:47:15.524
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:47:18.024 --> 00:47:20.514
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:47:22.744 --> 00:47:27.084
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:47:45.264 --> 00:47:46.184
Brother Naveen.

00:47:49.344 --> 00:47:50.514
What do you want?

00:47:51.564 --> 00:47:52.934
I have come to a decision.

00:47:53.524 --> 00:47:54.484
Have you changed your mind?

00:47:55.354 --> 00:47:56.464
Not at all.

00:47:59.124 --> 00:47:59.974
Then?

00:48:00.854 --> 00:48:03.484
I told you the other day
that Arjun is interesting.

00:48:04.414 --> 00:48:05.604
Now I think I like him.

00:48:08.834 --> 00:48:09.774
Why are you laughing?

00:48:10.114 --> 00:48:11.354
You are too late.

00:48:14.644 --> 00:48:17.734
Teju told me that you'd
be coming up with a plan soon.

00:48:18.384 --> 00:48:19.474
Perfect prediction.

00:48:21.714 --> 00:48:22.814
You are struggling a lot.

00:48:24.384 --> 00:48:25.464
Do one thing.

00:48:26.114 --> 00:48:27.234
Go and ask Teju for help.

00:48:27.424 --> 00:48:30.234
She will give you a better idea
to take this hospital back.

00:48:30.434 --> 00:48:32.144
Do I look like a joke to you?

00:48:32.414 --> 00:48:34.554
I am serious, Manasa.

00:48:35.274 --> 00:48:38.264
If you leave that,
you have only one option left.

00:48:40.224 --> 00:48:43.564
Work as a psychiatrist
in the same hospital.

00:48:43.984 --> 00:48:45.814
Lead a peaceful and happy life.

00:48:46.024 --> 00:48:46.894
How is it?

00:48:48.264 --> 00:48:51.024
Instead, you want
to take over the hospital.

00:48:51.694 --> 00:48:53.194
I am not interested
in this hospital.

00:48:53.294 --> 00:48:56.314
Madan has also left.
Then why do you want it?

00:48:57.834 --> 00:48:59.314
Wait and watch.

00:48:59.644 --> 00:49:02.444
Arjun will fall in love with me
and I will take back this hospital.

00:49:04.114 --> 00:49:07.894
Manasa, whatever you have planned
so far has not brought you any fruit.

00:49:08.494 --> 00:49:09.474
It won't either.

00:49:10.464 --> 00:49:12.734
That too, in the matter
of Arjun and Reena..

00:49:14.184 --> 00:49:15.984
There is no chance.

00:49:16.494 --> 00:49:18.194
Because I know them very well.

00:49:18.734 --> 00:49:19.604
What do you know?

00:49:21.484 --> 00:49:23.564
Wherever they go,
no matter how much they fight

00:49:23.614 --> 00:49:25.024
regardless of the misunderstanding,

00:49:25.094 --> 00:49:27.604
Arjun will come in search of Reena.

00:49:27.764 --> 00:49:29.734
Similarly, Reena will go to Arjun.

00:49:30.394 --> 00:49:32.584
Maybe they have a bad time now,
so they are like this.

00:49:33.894 --> 00:49:35.694
I think you are wasting your time.

00:49:35.924 --> 00:49:37.104
Go, get back to work.

00:49:43.424 --> 00:49:44.314
Sir.
- Yeah.

00:49:45.594 --> 00:49:47.244
Sir, I did take her
directly to the CT

00:49:47.404 --> 00:49:48.944
and did everything as you said.

00:49:49.584 --> 00:49:50.694
But the patient passed away.

00:49:52.944 --> 00:49:55.454
I think we should have followed
Dr. Radhi's procedure.

00:49:55.814 --> 00:49:57.324
What do you mean, Reena?

00:49:57.424 --> 00:50:00.194
I mean, if we had
followed her instructions

00:50:00.354 --> 00:50:01.654
she would've had a chance.

00:50:02.764 --> 00:50:04.884
We have already discussed this.
Why didn't you say anything then?

00:50:07.574 --> 00:50:09.724
As you insisted
that we should do as you said..

00:50:09.954 --> 00:50:10.914
Reena.
- That's why..

00:50:11.064 --> 00:50:13.234
No, Radhi, let her explain.

00:50:13.874 --> 00:50:15.884
What exactly happened
because of what I said?

00:50:17.274 --> 00:50:19.854
We immediately took her to the CT
without stabilising her first.

00:50:20.264 --> 00:50:21.814
Of course, the patient
was hypertensive.

00:50:21.894 --> 00:50:25.234
Well, internal haemorrhage.
So, what is the outcome?

00:50:25.844 --> 00:50:26.894
The patient died.

00:50:27.554 --> 00:50:29.064
Right, what else?

00:50:30.344 --> 00:50:32.564
If we had carefully intubated her

00:50:33.234 --> 00:50:35.604
and started the scan
after giving her the medication..

00:50:36.444 --> 00:50:37.564
If we had done that?

00:50:37.774 --> 00:50:40.884
The patient already had cerebral
oedema, so saturation was low.

00:50:41.014 --> 00:50:42.394
And internal haemorrhage?

00:50:42.834 --> 00:50:44.684
Even then, the patient
would have died.

00:50:45.164 --> 00:50:46.734
Yes, she would have died.
What else?

00:50:48.854 --> 00:50:51.394
If we had intubated her
slowly with medications

00:50:51.854 --> 00:50:53.684
and stabilising her

00:50:54.144 --> 00:50:55.604
and then taken her to the CT..

00:50:56.524 --> 00:50:58.434
Again, internal haemorrhage.

00:50:58.844 --> 00:51:00.314
Do you see
what I am trying to say here?

00:51:00.724 --> 00:51:03.774
The survival rate was very low
no matter which way we go.

00:51:03.854 --> 00:51:05.434
Your way, my way, or Radhi's way.

00:51:05.604 --> 00:51:07.644
Whatever, the outcome
would have been the same.

00:51:08.194 --> 00:51:10.354
But that doesn't mean my procedure
was wrong, Reena.

00:51:11.094 --> 00:51:11.924
Right, Radhi?

00:51:18.514 --> 00:51:20.624
She agrees with me.
That's why she left.

00:51:20.734 --> 00:51:22.604
Otherwise, she would
have definitely debated.

00:51:23.154 --> 00:51:24.714
Do you understand what I am saying?

00:51:25.414 --> 00:51:28.274
First, learn how to talk to whom.

00:51:29.074 --> 00:51:31.824
Then, learn to respect the decision
made by senior doctors.

00:51:33.034 --> 00:51:35.774
Sir, I said it
for the sake of the patient.

00:51:35.954 --> 00:51:38.204
I understand that your concern
for the patient was on point.

00:51:38.704 --> 00:51:42.124
But you should not pretend
that you know more than us.

00:51:42.644 --> 00:51:43.524
That's not correct.

00:51:44.854 --> 00:51:45.774
Sorry, sir.

00:51:57.064 --> 00:51:57.954
What?

00:52:01.454 --> 00:52:04.274
Ma'am, why don't you
become the chief doctor now?

00:52:06.514 --> 00:52:09.104
No, Teju, if I take up
to that position now,

00:52:09.164 --> 00:52:11.434
I would have to handle
more responsibilities.

00:52:11.904 --> 00:52:13.984
Even now, you are handling
the same responsibilities.

00:52:15.654 --> 00:52:17.734
Regardless of whether
Dr. Preetham was here or not,

00:52:18.154 --> 00:52:20.474
all the staff here
are trying to follow you.

00:52:20.684 --> 00:52:23.354
Even if there is any problem,
we ask you for solutions.

00:52:24.554 --> 00:52:25.684
It's temporary, right?

00:52:25.824 --> 00:52:27.234
You can be the chief doctor.

00:52:28.924 --> 00:52:29.754
No, Reena.

00:52:29.844 --> 00:52:32.484
I am not mentally
ready for that yet.

00:52:33.724 --> 00:52:35.634
Since there is no chief doctor

00:52:36.314 --> 00:52:37.894
everyone needs your help.

00:52:39.964 --> 00:52:40.864
Yes, ma'am.

00:52:41.584 --> 00:52:44.774
In this crucial time,
you should be the chief doctor.

00:52:48.864 --> 00:52:50.404
Ma'am, Rocky is calling me.

00:52:50.604 --> 00:52:52.354
I don't know what it is,
I will go and check.

00:53:09.534 --> 00:53:10.484
Son-in-law.

00:53:11.394 --> 00:53:12.234
How are you?

00:53:12.764 --> 00:53:14.314
I am fine, how are you?

00:53:14.484 --> 00:53:15.684
I am fine, Son-in-law.

00:53:16.174 --> 00:53:17.544
When did you come back?

00:53:19.284 --> 00:53:20.234
It's been a while.

00:53:21.474 --> 00:53:24.354
I left my documents upstairs.
I came here to get them.

00:53:24.774 --> 00:53:25.604
What is this?

00:53:25.894 --> 00:53:27.864
You are talking as if this
is someone else's house.

00:53:28.064 --> 00:53:28.994
Come in.

00:53:37.454 --> 00:53:38.354
Son-in-law.

00:53:39.984 --> 00:53:42.024
I am leaving.
- What is this?

00:53:42.134 --> 00:53:45.684
You are already leaving.
Have some tea before you go.

00:53:45.814 --> 00:53:47.984
No, I have to leave.
- Please, Son-in-law, sit.

00:53:55.084 --> 00:53:56.354
What is going on?

00:53:57.414 --> 00:53:58.484
Radhi is here.

00:53:59.084 --> 00:54:00.664
You are somewhere else.

00:54:02.334 --> 00:54:03.144
Son-in-law.

00:54:03.894 --> 00:54:05.184
What Radhi did was wrong.

00:54:06.504 --> 00:54:07.774
I am not denying it.

00:54:09.444 --> 00:54:12.314
But Radhi was a young girl.

00:54:13.504 --> 00:54:14.814
Her mother had passed away.

00:54:16.414 --> 00:54:18.814
I didn't know how
to take care of her.

00:54:21.744 --> 00:54:25.064
Before I could learn how,
such an incident had taken place.

00:54:25.924 --> 00:54:29.734
It was wrong that Radhi
didn't tell you about it.

00:54:30.914 --> 00:54:33.734
But I am also a reason behind it.

00:54:34.184 --> 00:54:35.604
You had hidden it
for so many years.

00:54:36.204 --> 00:54:37.234
I feel bad.

00:54:38.844 --> 00:54:41.924
But my question is, why
didn't you tell me about it?

00:54:43.104 --> 00:54:45.354
Your worries are valid.

00:54:46.164 --> 00:54:47.144
I can understand.

00:54:48.394 --> 00:54:51.184
But what could we have done?

00:54:52.434 --> 00:54:55.024
Radhi remembers the past.

00:54:55.234 --> 00:54:56.934
That's why she
doesn't accept Reena.

00:54:57.444 --> 00:55:01.214
Let's assume
that she told you about it.

00:55:02.294 --> 00:55:05.394
If you blame her
for it in the future

00:55:05.834 --> 00:55:06.994
where can she go?

00:55:07.774 --> 00:55:08.814
What will she do?

00:55:09.164 --> 00:55:13.604
Son-in-law, you know Radhi
as a bold and fearless lady today.

00:55:14.964 --> 00:55:16.474
But she wasn't always like that.

00:55:17.404 --> 00:55:21.694
This incident changed her.

00:55:23.264 --> 00:55:24.104
Son-in-law.

00:55:24.734 --> 00:55:25.684
You know it.

00:55:26.554 --> 00:55:28.204
Radhi loves you a lot.

00:55:28.814 --> 00:55:31.354
She wants you and
the kids to be with her.

00:55:32.234 --> 00:55:35.784
It's not right to ask for a divorce

00:55:36.254 --> 00:55:40.114
for an incident that
happened long ago.

00:55:41.394 --> 00:55:42.254
Son-in-law.

00:55:43.234 --> 00:55:46.604
I apologise to you for all
the things that went wrong.

00:55:47.484 --> 00:55:49.734
I am ready to fall
at your feet and apologise.

00:55:50.624 --> 00:55:51.504
But..

00:55:51.974 --> 00:55:52.814
Please.

00:55:53.944 --> 00:55:55.444
Don't punish Radhi.

00:55:56.094 --> 00:55:58.324
Please try to get over this.

00:55:58.494 --> 00:56:00.524
Radhi has seen a lot in her life.

00:56:01.014 --> 00:56:03.094
She can't bear such a punishment.

00:56:04.134 --> 00:56:05.054
Please.

00:56:06.944 --> 00:56:07.984
I am leaving.

00:56:15.654 --> 00:56:16.504
Dev.

00:56:35.344 --> 00:56:36.394
Dev.

00:56:40.844 --> 00:56:42.194
Dev..

00:57:09.334 --> 00:57:11.224
I don't know what to do.

00:57:11.914 --> 00:57:14.874
I don't know
what to tell Sid and Divi.

00:57:15.544 --> 00:57:19.174
Vijay is irritating me a lot
when I go to the hospital.

00:57:20.464 --> 00:57:22.014
You saw how Dev treated me.

00:57:25.094 --> 00:57:28.514
If Dev finds out that
Vijay is Reena's father

00:57:29.774 --> 00:57:31.314
I don't know what will happen.

00:57:32.304 --> 00:57:34.354
If Vijay finds out that
Reena is his daughter

00:57:34.444 --> 00:57:35.694
I don't know what will happen.

00:57:36.894 --> 00:57:38.394
If Reena finds out the truth

00:57:38.464 --> 00:57:40.144
I don't know how
she will handle it.

00:57:42.884 --> 00:57:44.944
I am scared, Dad.

00:57:45.074 --> 00:57:47.274
I feel like I'm going mad.

00:57:49.984 --> 00:57:50.814
Radhi.

00:57:53.444 --> 00:57:54.694
It's my fault.

00:57:56.104 --> 00:58:00.194
We should have told this
to your husband sooner.

00:58:02.754 --> 00:58:04.984
We can't change anything now.

00:58:07.274 --> 00:58:11.894
I am scared of everything that is
happening in front of my eyes.

00:58:14.274 --> 00:58:15.234
Radhi.

00:58:18.984 --> 00:58:20.484
No matter what the problem is,

00:58:22.094 --> 00:58:23.854
you should concentrate
on your work.

00:58:24.674 --> 00:58:28.984
That will help you relax.

00:58:32.274 --> 00:58:33.824
Forget all these problems.

00:58:34.204 --> 00:58:36.754
I will solve it for you.

00:58:37.944 --> 00:58:39.484
I will solve it for you.

00:58:40.474 --> 00:58:41.314
Trust me.

00:58:46.344 --> 00:58:47.194
Radhi.

00:58:47.924 --> 00:58:48.874
Radhi.

00:59:00.274 --> 00:59:04.234
Our combination is not so great.

00:59:05.204 --> 00:59:06.024
I know.

00:59:06.654 --> 00:59:07.484
But what to do?

00:59:07.654 --> 00:59:09.444
I can't trust anyone
in this hospital.

00:59:09.994 --> 00:59:11.744
So am I not on the list?

00:59:11.844 --> 00:59:13.524
You are the first person.

00:59:13.714 --> 00:59:16.274
That's why I called you first.

00:59:16.854 --> 00:59:18.274
What did I do?

00:59:18.934 --> 00:59:20.944
Tell me.
- If anyone asks about me,

00:59:21.234 --> 00:59:22.694
don't tell them
what you told Charu.

00:59:23.174 --> 00:59:26.124
Will there be
more girls like Charu?

00:59:26.354 --> 00:59:28.194
How can that be?
You are here to prevent that.

00:59:28.594 --> 00:59:30.144
No one will come.

00:59:30.844 --> 00:59:33.414
No one will come, right?
Then I'll leave.

00:59:34.374 --> 00:59:37.564
Mr. Kamal, you are
testing my patience.

00:59:39.564 --> 00:59:40.444
Look.
- I will.

00:59:40.524 --> 00:59:41.984
If you see Charu again,

00:59:42.124 --> 00:59:45.644
tell her that you were only
trying to tease me.

00:59:45.864 --> 00:59:49.154
Oh, no, Rocky!
I don't lie.

00:59:49.404 --> 00:59:51.104
Don't you lie?

00:59:51.244 --> 00:59:52.734
You would have gone to jail.

00:59:52.904 --> 00:59:54.484
You escaped because of Amaya.

00:59:54.954 --> 00:59:56.124
Why are you talking about that?

00:59:56.204 --> 00:59:59.404
Do you and Charu have a problem
because of what I told her?

01:00:00.024 --> 01:00:02.484
That's what I've been telling you.

01:00:03.784 --> 01:00:04.694
You, too, have a problem.

01:00:05.054 --> 01:00:05.984
I have a problem too.

01:00:06.244 --> 01:00:08.394
But I don't know
what the problem is.

01:00:08.774 --> 01:00:10.284
Is it because of love?

01:00:10.354 --> 01:00:12.634
Kamal, you have a problem
in your relationship.

01:00:12.714 --> 01:00:14.194
I have a problem
because of my relationship.

01:00:14.344 --> 01:00:15.814
I am confused.
- Same pinch.

01:00:16.544 --> 01:00:18.234
Interesting, tell me more.

01:00:18.894 --> 01:00:19.854
Tell you more?

01:00:21.164 --> 01:00:22.024
She says she trusts me.

01:00:22.604 --> 01:00:25.604
She wants to check my phone.
She should believe in love, right?

01:00:25.814 --> 01:00:27.864
Does she have to check my phone
to prove that I love her?

01:00:29.024 --> 01:00:30.394
Don't say it like that.

01:00:30.734 --> 01:00:35.154
Since you look the part,
she might have suspected you.

01:00:35.274 --> 01:00:36.604
Your behaviours match.

01:00:36.784 --> 01:00:38.604
Charu might have
suspected you in that manner.

01:00:39.394 --> 01:00:41.984
I am not a social media person.

01:00:42.894 --> 01:00:45.274
Shall we ask Charu to love you?

01:00:45.384 --> 01:00:47.854
How can I love that girl?

01:00:47.924 --> 01:00:52.144
If anyone asks about me,
tell them good things about me.

01:00:52.474 --> 01:00:54.134
I can try,
but there is nothing to say.

01:00:54.854 --> 01:00:56.734
Then just leave from there.

01:00:57.094 --> 01:00:58.334
I will try that.

01:00:58.664 --> 01:00:59.644
You will try well.

01:01:01.814 --> 01:01:02.944
Oh, God..

01:01:06.564 --> 01:01:08.064
Are you sorry?

01:01:10.394 --> 01:01:13.314
You talk without thinking first.
Then you apologise.

01:01:13.684 --> 01:01:14.894
Sorry, Kamal.

01:01:16.094 --> 01:01:17.354
What is your problem?

01:01:17.834 --> 01:01:18.894
We like each other.

01:01:19.274 --> 01:01:20.234
But you said no.

01:01:20.934 --> 01:01:23.144
You returned the money I gave you
and asked me to leave.

01:01:24.104 --> 01:01:26.774
What do I do now
that you're apologising?

01:01:26.894 --> 01:01:28.194
Why are you confusing me?

01:01:30.304 --> 01:01:31.314
Why are you laughing?

01:01:31.444 --> 01:01:34.094
Hey! I am Abhinaya.
- Abhi?

01:01:35.684 --> 01:01:38.104
Why are you whining?

01:01:38.234 --> 01:01:41.344
My sister is scolding you, right?
Why don't you leave her?

01:01:41.524 --> 01:01:44.524
People don't like me so easily.

01:01:44.964 --> 01:01:46.104
That girl likes me.

01:01:46.654 --> 01:01:47.984
I, too, like her.

01:01:48.714 --> 01:01:49.854
How can I leave her then?

01:01:50.204 --> 01:01:54.364
Being timid doesn't mean
she is a good girl.

01:01:54.644 --> 01:01:56.694
Be careful with Amaya.

01:01:56.844 --> 01:01:58.394
I should be careful with you.

01:01:58.774 --> 01:02:00.404
You've caused
an uproar in this hospital.

01:02:00.694 --> 01:02:01.854
Why did you come back?

01:02:02.364 --> 01:02:03.524
I came to talk to you.

01:02:04.024 --> 01:02:06.194
To me? Why?

01:02:06.774 --> 01:02:09.024
You gave me a number
and asked me to try for a job.

01:02:09.104 --> 01:02:10.814
Yes.
- I got that job.

01:02:11.274 --> 01:02:12.694
Really? Superb.

01:02:12.814 --> 01:02:14.644
Work well.

01:02:14.714 --> 01:02:18.054
Don't send Amaya to your work
and create problems in the future.

01:02:18.234 --> 01:02:19.394
I won't.
- Okay.

01:02:19.604 --> 01:02:20.604
All the best, I'll leave.

01:02:21.774 --> 01:02:22.624
Hey.

01:02:23.604 --> 01:02:26.194
Didn't they teach you
how to respect others?

01:02:26.764 --> 01:02:27.734
Tell me.

01:02:28.644 --> 01:02:31.394
If you want something, wait for it.

01:02:32.004 --> 01:02:35.064
If it's yours, it will come back.

01:02:35.224 --> 01:02:36.234
Okay?
- What if it doesn't?

01:02:36.514 --> 01:02:37.774
Then it's not yours.

01:02:38.634 --> 01:02:41.984
If you easily get it,
what is the fun in that?

01:02:42.054 --> 01:02:46.484
Looks like both of you have
been fed with philosophy.

01:02:46.574 --> 01:02:48.624
That's why you
are talking like this.

01:02:48.864 --> 01:02:51.084
I am serious.

01:02:51.524 --> 01:02:53.734
Amaya likes you a lot.

01:02:54.194 --> 01:02:55.694
But wait for it.

01:02:58.024 --> 01:02:58.874
Okay.

01:02:59.604 --> 01:03:01.394
I'll listen to you.

01:03:01.804 --> 01:03:03.124
I'll leave.

01:03:03.314 --> 01:03:04.804
You go safely.
- Okay.

01:03:11.824 --> 01:03:13.234
Why did you ask me to come?

01:03:14.044 --> 01:03:15.944
I have some work inside.

01:03:16.024 --> 01:03:16.904
I'll leave.

01:03:17.044 --> 01:03:20.444
Hey, you apologised
and I forgave you, right?

01:03:20.694 --> 01:03:22.444
Why are you running away
as soon as you saw me?

01:03:22.734 --> 01:03:26.104
You'd feel uncomfortable
with me around, that's why. - Hey!

01:03:26.834 --> 01:03:28.494
What do you think about Reena?

01:03:28.734 --> 01:03:30.184
She won't feel uncomfortable.

01:03:30.394 --> 01:03:33.194
I asked you all to come here
to discuss something important.

01:03:35.284 --> 01:03:36.104
Sit down.

01:03:38.524 --> 01:03:41.854
Directly or indirectly, I have
helped in all your relationships.

01:03:42.314 --> 01:03:44.604
Now I need your help.

01:03:44.684 --> 01:03:45.524
Wait..

01:03:45.854 --> 01:03:47.274
You haven't helped my relationship.

01:03:47.984 --> 01:03:50.234
I helped you stop your engagement.

01:03:51.944 --> 01:03:52.944
What do you want me to do?

01:03:53.984 --> 01:03:56.274
You have to unite Charu and me.

01:03:57.894 --> 01:03:59.314
Tell me, what should I do?

01:03:59.354 --> 01:04:02.164
If Charu asks about me

01:04:02.444 --> 01:04:05.064
you have to tell her
that I'm a good person.

01:04:05.284 --> 01:04:07.334
Rocky, you are a good person.

01:04:07.404 --> 01:04:10.044
Nilofer, I know that
you'd say it to my face.

01:04:10.124 --> 01:04:11.714
But you won't say it
behind my back.

01:04:12.434 --> 01:04:14.564
You don't have to trouble yourself.

01:04:15.184 --> 01:04:18.444
I'll make a plan for us to go out.
Come there and tell her..

01:04:18.814 --> 01:04:22.004
Rocky is a good person.
- You must be lucky to have him.

01:04:22.564 --> 01:04:24.534
That's too much.
Start slowly.

01:04:25.604 --> 01:04:28.484
If you increase her trust in me
and give her hope..

01:04:29.264 --> 01:04:30.184
Then?

01:04:31.434 --> 01:04:33.064
I'll marry Charu and settle down.

01:04:33.364 --> 01:04:34.564
Marriage?
- Marriage?

01:04:36.264 --> 01:04:37.294
Ramakrishna.

01:04:37.744 --> 01:04:39.974
Why do you want to get married?
- Reena.

01:04:40.524 --> 01:04:43.064
I don't know who is stopping you
and Arjun from getting together.

01:04:43.574 --> 01:04:44.824
But I am not like that.

01:04:44.994 --> 01:04:46.504
At the time when
everything was going well

01:04:46.644 --> 01:04:49.484
someone like a Sleeper Cell
messed it up for me.

01:04:49.604 --> 01:04:52.204
Marriage is a big commitment.

01:04:52.374 --> 01:04:53.234
I know.

01:04:53.874 --> 01:04:55.724
Charu is beautiful.
She is a good girl.

01:04:56.084 --> 01:04:57.884
Her mother and father are okay.

01:04:58.084 --> 01:04:59.444
So I am okay with that family.

01:04:59.534 --> 01:05:01.104
Is her family okay with you?

01:05:01.194 --> 01:05:03.174
Why would she talk to me
about marriage otherwise?

01:05:03.444 --> 01:05:04.524
Ramakrishna.

01:05:04.984 --> 01:05:06.194
Don't get married.

01:05:06.614 --> 01:05:08.314
Reena, you say this now.

01:05:08.714 --> 01:05:11.604
But you will be the first
person to get married. - I won't.

01:05:13.434 --> 01:05:14.444
Look, Reena.

01:05:14.564 --> 01:05:17.394
I don't care whether you get married
or get back together with Arjun.

01:05:17.524 --> 01:05:19.354
But I want to get married to Charu.

01:05:19.584 --> 01:05:21.144
Rocky, what did you do

01:05:21.234 --> 01:05:23.194
when you were in a long-distance
relationship with Charu?

01:05:23.254 --> 01:05:24.854
I swear I didn't do anything.

01:05:25.024 --> 01:05:26.814
I was busy with my work.

01:05:27.084 --> 01:05:28.874
You would have
explained this to her.

01:05:28.944 --> 01:05:31.314
Don't you want to know
what she did in return?

01:05:31.664 --> 01:05:32.484
Hey.

01:05:32.814 --> 01:05:34.484
You are talking bad about a girl.

01:05:34.754 --> 01:05:36.394
I am not saying anything wrong.

01:05:36.484 --> 01:05:37.694
I am asking you to find out.

01:05:37.784 --> 01:05:41.644
Without any reason, why would
she wants to get married now?

01:05:42.674 --> 01:05:45.524
So you investigate Charu.

01:05:47.234 --> 01:05:48.644
Is it?
- Yes.

01:05:48.984 --> 01:05:50.024
Ramakrishna.

01:05:50.604 --> 01:05:51.644
Don't get married.

01:05:51.704 --> 01:05:53.444
Stop it.

01:05:53.644 --> 01:05:55.314
I came to you for help.

01:05:55.584 --> 01:05:58.004
But you are saying the same thing.

01:05:58.654 --> 01:06:01.644
She is influencing me
to turn against Charu.

01:06:02.194 --> 01:06:03.944
Go away, I don't need your help..

01:06:06.584 --> 01:06:07.664
I don't need anything.

01:07:57.103 --> 01:08:00.083
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:08:02.123 --> 01:08:04.543
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:08:07.253 --> 01:08:09.993
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:08:11.913 --> 01:08:14.213
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:08:14.393 --> 01:08:16.873
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:08:16.963 --> 01:08:19.533
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:08:19.693 --> 01:08:22.243
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:08:24.603 --> 01:08:27.073
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:08:29.673 --> 01:08:32.783
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:08:34.293 --> 01:08:38.533
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:08:50.783 --> 01:08:51.643
Hey.

01:08:52.283 --> 01:08:54.153
There is an election
for the school pupil leader post.

01:08:54.643 --> 01:08:56.403
Did you know?
- I know.

01:08:57.233 --> 01:08:59.323
I didn't ask you.
Radhi.

01:08:59.783 --> 01:09:01.323
You should run for that post.

01:09:02.003 --> 01:09:04.103
Why are you asking me
to do that out of the blue?

01:09:04.423 --> 01:09:06.473
Then? Everything here

01:09:06.663 --> 01:09:08.873
including the cultural fests,
need permission from Vikram.

01:09:09.253 --> 01:09:10.613
Isn't he an SPL?

01:09:10.733 --> 01:09:11.573
Correct.

01:09:11.703 --> 01:09:13.243
But he has a lot of friends.

01:09:13.533 --> 01:09:15.403
So, whoever becomes the SPL here

01:09:15.673 --> 01:09:17.363
nothing will happen
here without asking him.

01:09:17.873 --> 01:09:19.903
But if you compete, you will win.

01:09:20.083 --> 01:09:21.973
Because you are studying well.

01:09:22.193 --> 01:09:23.443
You are active in sports.

01:09:23.663 --> 01:09:24.533
Why don't you go for it?

01:09:25.153 --> 01:09:26.483
Get lost.
I can't do it.

01:09:26.553 --> 01:09:27.863
I am not interested in all that.

01:09:28.663 --> 01:09:29.763
Just try it, Radhi.

01:09:29.963 --> 01:09:32.153
This will be a new
experience for you.

01:09:32.303 --> 01:09:35.753
And you said you wanted
to exact revenge on Vikram.

01:09:36.053 --> 01:09:37.943
If you win, we can
put an end to him.

01:09:38.173 --> 01:09:40.403
That's not a reason
to run an election.

01:09:40.513 --> 01:09:41.963
Being an SPL is not so easy.

01:09:42.033 --> 01:09:43.693
Why is she talking like this?

01:09:44.033 --> 01:09:45.493
Vikram is irritating us.

01:09:47.073 --> 01:09:48.033
You are right, Radhi.

01:09:48.823 --> 01:09:50.473
You don't have
to run this election.

01:09:50.643 --> 01:09:51.573
Why?

01:09:51.903 --> 01:09:53.153
You can't do it, Radhi.

01:09:53.813 --> 01:09:54.783
Why can't I do it?

01:09:55.273 --> 01:09:56.193
You can't do it.

01:09:56.403 --> 01:10:00.403
You can't stand against these
guys and win the election.

01:10:00.833 --> 01:10:01.743
Why can't I do it?

01:10:02.323 --> 01:10:03.163
Then prove it.

01:10:03.313 --> 01:10:04.323
Why should I?

01:10:04.413 --> 01:10:06.493
I don't have to prove anything
by doing this.

01:10:07.793 --> 01:10:10.653
You are irritating her when
I asked you to convince her.

01:10:11.453 --> 01:10:12.823
Dude, she is scared.

01:10:13.153 --> 01:10:14.403
What is there to be scared of?

01:10:14.753 --> 01:10:16.443
You are scared
to take up responsibilities.

01:10:16.663 --> 01:10:18.033
I am not scared of anything.

01:10:19.353 --> 01:10:21.193
Guys, go to your seats.

01:10:23.443 --> 01:10:25.263
Students, from this class

01:10:25.363 --> 01:10:27.693
who wants to run for the SPL?

01:10:32.933 --> 01:10:35.363
Why isn't anyone volunteering?

01:10:39.443 --> 01:10:40.403
Radhi!

01:10:41.113 --> 01:10:42.153
Radhi!

01:10:42.783 --> 01:10:43.693
Tell him, Radhi.

01:10:47.363 --> 01:10:48.533
She won't do it.

01:10:54.903 --> 01:10:55.743
Radhi, sir!

01:11:29.933 --> 01:11:31.193
Sorry for making you wait, guys.

01:11:35.033 --> 01:11:36.403
Reena, let's start.

01:11:37.193 --> 01:11:38.763
The patient's name
is Palani, age 52.

01:11:39.073 --> 01:11:40.513
He was admitted
because of a swollen leg.

01:11:40.553 --> 01:11:42.323
When further
investigation was done

01:11:42.393 --> 01:11:44.823
we came to know that his urinary
output is low. And fatigue, too.

01:11:45.253 --> 01:11:47.073
These are his initial lab reports.

01:11:47.193 --> 01:11:48.753
Due to his
declining kidney function

01:11:48.843 --> 01:11:50.323
we suspected renal failure.

01:11:50.803 --> 01:11:52.593
Later, when we tested his liver,
we came to know

01:11:52.623 --> 01:11:54.363
that it is advanced liver cirrhosis.

01:11:54.513 --> 01:11:56.943
INR, rubin, albumin,
everything is abnormal.

01:11:57.703 --> 01:11:58.653
What is your diagnosis?

01:11:58.773 --> 01:12:00.503
Hepatorenal syndrome, type 1

01:12:01.503 --> 01:12:04.283
Acute kidney failure
to end-stage liver disease.

01:12:04.533 --> 01:12:05.573
Treatment plan?

01:12:05.903 --> 01:12:08.743
Ma'am, I think it would be better
if we ask you for a suggestion.

01:12:10.113 --> 01:12:11.113
To whom?

01:12:11.403 --> 01:12:12.873
To me or to Radhi?

01:12:12.943 --> 01:12:15.993
Sir, they wanted to get
an opinion from both of you.

01:12:16.453 --> 01:12:17.963
That's why I asked
you to come here.

01:12:18.853 --> 01:12:20.573
Sir, what is your suggestion?

01:12:23.383 --> 01:12:24.253
Liver damage.

01:12:24.743 --> 01:12:27.113
Liver transplant.
Find a donor, get the job done.

01:12:27.493 --> 01:12:28.903
You said it so easily, Vijay.

01:12:29.813 --> 01:12:31.613
How can we do only
the liver transplantation?

01:12:31.903 --> 01:12:33.193
What about the kidney failure?

01:12:33.613 --> 01:12:35.213
You said acute
kidney failure, right?

01:12:35.273 --> 01:12:37.493
So, it is still
functioning somewhat.

01:12:38.163 --> 01:12:39.743
What you are saying
is very wrong, Vijay.

01:12:40.603 --> 01:12:43.193
If we do this treatment alone,
the patient's life is in danger.

01:12:43.573 --> 01:12:44.743
There are unnecessary expenses.

01:12:44.843 --> 01:12:46.823
It is going to cost Rs. 30 lakhs
for the liver transplantation.

01:12:46.903 --> 01:12:47.903
That is more priority now.

01:12:47.993 --> 01:12:50.073
Do it first and then
do a kidney transplant.

01:12:50.273 --> 01:12:52.423
But if we have to do
both at the same time..

01:12:52.533 --> 01:12:53.823
You don't have to be adamant.

01:12:54.333 --> 01:12:56.673
Sir, but we can only do what
is right for the patient, right?

01:12:56.753 --> 01:12:58.543
That's right, we have to do
what is right for the patient.

01:12:58.613 --> 01:12:59.903
So, we can do what I said.

01:13:02.043 --> 01:13:03.613
There is a financial
commitment too, right?

01:13:04.853 --> 01:13:06.563
Kidney is functioning
somewhat okay.

01:13:06.633 --> 01:13:07.863
The structure is intact.

01:13:08.023 --> 01:13:09.823
When the hepatic pressure
comes down, it will be fine.

01:13:10.073 --> 01:13:11.283
It won't be like that here.

01:13:12.103 --> 01:13:13.863
Creatinine levels are elevated.

01:13:14.453 --> 01:13:18.073
And in the last five days, the
urine levels have reduced by half.

01:13:18.213 --> 01:13:21.993
And we are suspecting
secondary tubular injury.

01:13:22.273 --> 01:13:24.993
As the urine level is low, it is
already affecting the kidney.

01:13:26.113 --> 01:13:27.403
We can't let that happen.

01:13:27.563 --> 01:13:29.283
Will you suggest
a combined transplant for that?

01:13:29.743 --> 01:13:32.023
It is not going to be easy, Radhi.
- Yes, it is not easy.

01:13:32.653 --> 01:13:34.823
But if we do
the liver transplant now

01:13:35.493 --> 01:13:38.063
we might face an acute
kidney failure in another month.

01:13:38.153 --> 01:13:39.113
We should avoid that.

01:13:40.083 --> 01:13:42.493
Reena, Teju, you follow what I say.

01:13:42.803 --> 01:13:44.533
Hello, how can you
take that decision?

01:13:44.723 --> 01:13:45.743
Are you the chief doctor?

01:13:47.983 --> 01:13:49.483
No.
- No, right?

01:13:49.533 --> 01:13:51.283
So they can follow
what I said, right, Arjun?

01:13:52.013 --> 01:13:54.613
Sir, you are the doctor here.

01:13:55.073 --> 01:13:55.933
Not me.

01:13:56.263 --> 01:13:58.943
You have to say what is right
for the patient and what to do.

01:14:00.133 --> 01:14:02.193
Arjun, the treatment
I suggested is correct.

01:14:02.203 --> 01:14:04.423
What I said is correct.
I'm not stupid.

01:14:04.733 --> 01:14:06.743
Vijay, how can you be so sure?

01:14:07.133 --> 01:14:09.693
This is what
all the doctors would say.

01:14:10.143 --> 01:14:11.903
This is going to be an
ongoing problem, Arjun.

01:14:12.103 --> 01:14:14.593
We are debating equally. But whose
decision are you going to take?

01:14:14.653 --> 01:14:15.823
Mine or her?

01:14:15.883 --> 01:14:18.113
This problem will continue
till there is a chief doctor.

01:14:18.263 --> 01:14:19.943
Sir, what can I do?

01:14:20.383 --> 01:14:23.743
The process to appoint the chief
doctor from my end has started.

01:14:24.853 --> 01:14:29.153
And, ma'am, I had asked you
to be the chief doctor temporarily.

01:14:30.583 --> 01:14:32.573
She won't accept it, Arjun.

01:14:32.633 --> 01:14:34.863
I mean, the chief doctor
has a lot of responsibilities.

01:14:34.933 --> 01:14:36.403
Maybe she wants to play it safe.

01:14:37.613 --> 01:14:39.113
Who is playing it safe?

01:14:39.423 --> 01:14:41.413
Yeah, it looks like it.
Anyway, you need guts for that.

01:14:41.503 --> 01:14:42.863
But she is not going to accept it.

01:14:42.953 --> 01:14:44.703
There is no point
in waiting for her, Arjun.

01:14:46.833 --> 01:14:47.653
Reena, Teju.

01:14:47.943 --> 01:14:49.153
Follow what I say.

01:14:49.743 --> 01:14:51.743
Hello.. How can you finalise it?

01:14:51.983 --> 01:14:54.493
Because I am the temporary
chief doctor of RK Hospital.

01:15:02.323 --> 01:15:03.353
Since when?

01:15:03.603 --> 01:15:05.283
From this moment onward.

01:15:11.363 --> 01:15:15.153
Arjun, I will hold the post till
you appoint another chief doctor.

01:15:15.913 --> 01:15:16.823
Sure, ma'am.

01:15:23.163 --> 01:15:23.993
Sure.

01:16:07.113 --> 01:16:08.533
Sir, what are you doing here?

01:16:08.963 --> 01:16:11.423
Um, the..

01:16:11.823 --> 01:16:13.153
Do you know him?

01:16:15.053 --> 01:16:15.903
I know him.

01:16:17.033 --> 01:16:18.033
Do you know him?

01:16:20.193 --> 01:16:21.653
No, I just met him.
That's why I asked you.

01:16:22.883 --> 01:16:23.713
Oh.

01:16:23.763 --> 01:16:26.323
He is Dr. Radhi's father.

01:16:27.083 --> 01:16:27.943
Oh.

01:16:28.113 --> 01:16:30.823
He comes for a general
check-up now and then.

01:16:32.723 --> 01:16:34.243
What happened?
Are you not feeling well?

01:16:36.183 --> 01:16:38.323
You are getting old.
Take care of your health, sir.

01:16:39.813 --> 01:16:41.443
Reena, give him
a thorough check-up.

01:16:43.193 --> 01:16:44.363
Come. Grand..

01:16:44.863 --> 01:16:47.363
Come on, sir.
- You go ahead, Doctor.

01:16:47.553 --> 01:16:48.383
I will come.

01:17:08.713 --> 01:17:10.403
I already told you, right?

01:17:11.103 --> 01:17:13.243
To vacate this place.

01:17:13.783 --> 01:17:15.193
I also told you, right?

01:17:15.743 --> 01:17:16.993
That I will not leave this place.

01:17:18.843 --> 01:17:20.903
You are happy that you got closure.

01:17:21.513 --> 01:17:22.363
I didn't get it.

01:17:22.753 --> 01:17:24.033
No one is worried about it.

01:17:24.783 --> 01:17:26.713
Everyone is happy.

01:17:26.783 --> 01:17:28.073
I don't get it, sir.

01:17:28.943 --> 01:17:31.443
Something happened to me.
I haven't come out of it.

01:17:32.023 --> 01:17:32.943
I didn't get married.

01:17:33.863 --> 01:17:35.363
But Radhi got married and moved on.

01:17:36.173 --> 01:17:37.573
That's what I don't understand.

01:17:39.573 --> 01:17:41.283
Whatever happened in her life

01:17:41.463 --> 01:17:42.863
happened in your life as well.

01:17:43.443 --> 01:17:45.743
But she is more affected.

01:17:46.313 --> 01:17:47.153
Exactly, sir.

01:17:47.823 --> 01:17:49.323
That's why I need to know how.

01:17:49.853 --> 01:17:51.113
That's the answer I need, old man.

01:17:52.783 --> 01:17:55.903
You have a health check-up, right?
Take care of your health, sir.

01:18:00.743 --> 01:18:01.653
Is he the one?

01:18:01.753 --> 01:18:03.963
Dr. Kumar.

01:18:04.063 --> 01:18:04.993
What was it? Vijay.

01:18:05.243 --> 01:18:06.193
Dr. Vijay.

01:18:07.363 --> 01:18:08.243
Yes, Grandpa.

01:18:08.523 --> 01:18:09.713
He is a good doctor.

01:18:09.993 --> 01:18:11.943
But I don't think
he is a good person.

01:18:12.893 --> 01:18:13.863
How do you say that?

01:18:14.403 --> 01:18:16.403
He has been irritating mom
ever since he came here.

01:18:16.623 --> 01:18:19.863
When he is talking,
he talks as if he knows mom.

01:18:21.073 --> 01:18:23.443
How would he know her?

01:18:25.073 --> 01:18:26.323
After he came here

01:18:27.413 --> 01:18:31.073
he might've found out her situation
and is trying to take advantage.

01:18:31.823 --> 01:18:33.693
How would he know that situation?

01:18:34.323 --> 01:18:36.993
He knows that situation somehow.

01:18:37.083 --> 01:18:38.323
How would I know if you ask me?

01:18:38.573 --> 01:18:41.253
You, be careful with him.

01:18:41.393 --> 01:18:42.283
That's it.

01:18:42.493 --> 01:18:43.863
Tell that to your daughter.

01:18:44.203 --> 01:18:46.783
I will tell my daughter and
my granddaughter, okay?

01:18:47.113 --> 01:18:48.403
Okay, Grandpa, give me your hand.

01:18:54.993 --> 01:18:55.943
Come, Manasa.

01:18:56.693 --> 01:18:58.963
Why didn't you attend
the session yesterday, Arjun?

01:18:59.363 --> 01:19:00.693
You didn't even attend my call.

01:19:01.243 --> 01:19:03.193
Sorry, I had some work.

01:19:03.753 --> 01:19:06.243
I wanted to call and inform you.
But I forgot.

01:19:07.743 --> 01:19:08.993
Were you at work?

01:19:09.303 --> 01:19:11.243
Or were you with Reena?

01:19:12.183 --> 01:19:13.613
I really had some work.

01:19:15.313 --> 01:19:17.363
How can you say
that I went with Reena?

01:19:17.793 --> 01:19:18.993
Why should I lie to you?

01:19:20.283 --> 01:19:21.573
I am just worried, Arjun.

01:19:22.023 --> 01:19:24.573
You have come only
for a few counselling sessions.

01:19:25.123 --> 01:19:27.573
But I have seen
many patients like you.

01:19:28.513 --> 01:19:29.403
No, Manasa.

01:19:30.733 --> 01:19:34.153
I feel that all our counselling
sessions are about Reena.

01:19:34.783 --> 01:19:38.533
All our sessions have
only been about Reena.

01:19:38.633 --> 01:19:42.363
Arjun..
- Because she is my trigger point.

01:19:42.843 --> 01:19:46.783
But I have had this issue
even before I met her.

01:19:46.943 --> 01:19:49.573
Which I've mentioned before.
- That is correct, Arjun.

01:19:49.603 --> 01:19:50.613
I agree with you.

01:19:50.663 --> 01:19:51.863
And..
- Not just that.

01:19:52.013 --> 01:19:52.923
Somewhere..

01:19:53.793 --> 01:19:56.113
I think you are thinking
this from the wrong angle. - Oh!

01:19:57.713 --> 01:20:00.363
So, have you become
an expert in this matter, Arjun?

01:20:01.243 --> 01:20:02.113
I didn't mean that.

01:20:05.593 --> 01:20:06.443
It's okay.

01:20:09.903 --> 01:20:11.783
You do whatever you feel like.

01:20:13.733 --> 01:20:15.243
You can go the way
you are going now.

01:20:16.333 --> 01:20:17.863
If it works, that's fine.

01:20:18.363 --> 01:20:19.203
Well.

01:20:19.343 --> 01:20:20.803
If this doesn't work..

01:20:22.353 --> 01:20:24.533
No, why should I be negative?

01:20:25.133 --> 01:20:26.003
Okay.

01:20:26.563 --> 01:20:30.183
Observe your emotions
from now on, let's see.

01:20:44.453 --> 01:20:45.783
Guna.
- Tell me.

01:20:46.853 --> 01:20:47.783
I want your house.

01:20:47.973 --> 01:20:48.853
Why?

01:20:49.243 --> 01:20:51.213
That is, Charu and I..

01:20:52.523 --> 01:20:55.193
You and Charu?
- Let me finish.

01:20:55.413 --> 01:20:57.253
It's not just Charu and me..

01:20:57.903 --> 01:20:58.773
Then?

01:20:59.453 --> 01:21:02.443
Reena, Nilofer, Kiran, all of them.

01:21:02.823 --> 01:21:03.743
Is it a party?

01:21:04.823 --> 01:21:06.073
I can't call it a party.

01:21:07.003 --> 01:21:08.493
If you and Anitha have any problems

01:21:08.633 --> 01:21:09.863
we help you, right?

01:21:11.003 --> 01:21:13.073
You are the reason why
Anitha and I are facing problems.

01:21:13.753 --> 01:21:16.943
Hey, nothing has happened
till now since you tried.

01:21:17.113 --> 01:21:18.153
Try to understand.
- Hey.

01:21:18.643 --> 01:21:20.383
Won't you help me
by giving your house key?

01:21:20.443 --> 01:21:22.473
No.
The last time you came over

01:21:22.533 --> 01:21:24.283
you tortured me
by asking me to wear her vest.

01:21:25.033 --> 01:21:26.033
I didn't like it.

01:21:26.353 --> 01:21:27.613
No one should come to my house.

01:21:28.033 --> 01:21:28.883
Hey!

01:21:28.973 --> 01:21:30.323
There is no alcohol this time.

01:21:30.383 --> 01:21:32.033
No drinking.
- Hey.

01:21:32.183 --> 01:21:33.443
This is what I am scared of.

01:21:33.653 --> 01:21:35.823
You're capable of many things
even when you're sober.

01:21:36.573 --> 01:21:38.743
Buddy! Rocky is a good boy.

01:21:39.443 --> 01:21:40.743
Hey, listen to me.

01:21:40.993 --> 01:21:42.073
Charu and I have a problem.

01:21:42.243 --> 01:21:44.153
If you help us get back together

01:21:44.363 --> 01:21:46.283
I will happily marry
Charu and settle down.

01:21:46.943 --> 01:21:48.033
Hey, Ramakrishna!

01:21:48.473 --> 01:21:50.113
Why do you want to get married?

01:21:50.543 --> 01:21:53.193
Hey! Why are you all
asking me the same question?

01:21:53.363 --> 01:21:54.443
Why shouldn't I get married?

01:21:54.553 --> 01:21:57.153
You shouldn't.
I can't convince Anitha.

01:21:57.623 --> 01:21:59.743
She has been glaring at everyone.

01:21:59.823 --> 01:22:02.113
Guna, it's time for the rounds,
let's go. - Hi.

01:22:03.083 --> 01:22:05.323
Buddy, ask her, she will agree.

01:22:08.573 --> 01:22:10.823
Senior!
- What's wrong with you?

01:22:11.193 --> 01:22:14.573
Senior, shall I bring Charu
over to your house?

01:22:14.813 --> 01:22:17.113
Hey, what do you
think my house is?

01:22:17.843 --> 01:22:18.663
No.

01:22:18.713 --> 01:22:20.823
What were you two
thinking about it?

01:22:21.063 --> 01:22:21.993
Rocky.

01:22:22.303 --> 01:22:23.153
No, senior.

01:22:23.273 --> 01:22:24.743
I just told him in detail.

01:22:25.163 --> 01:22:26.303
Ask him and find out.

01:22:26.703 --> 01:22:29.033
Just say yes.
- I can't do that.

01:22:29.303 --> 01:22:31.243
When you come to my house,
you jump on the bed.

01:22:31.583 --> 01:22:33.033
You even question
the hair on the floor.

01:22:33.193 --> 01:22:35.493
I won't allow it.
You overdo everything.

01:22:35.763 --> 01:22:37.323
Senior, I swear.

01:22:37.563 --> 01:22:39.493
I won't see anything
other than Charu.

01:22:40.193 --> 01:22:41.103
Please, senior.

01:22:41.283 --> 01:22:43.243
Just like how you got Ravi married

01:22:43.583 --> 01:22:47.303
help me get married to Charu
and brighten my life.

01:22:47.373 --> 01:22:48.653
Marriage?
- Yes.

01:22:50.503 --> 01:22:51.633
Hey, Ramakrishna.

01:22:51.673 --> 01:22:52.743
Why do you..
- Senior!

01:22:54.943 --> 01:22:56.193
Will I get the house key or not?

01:22:58.533 --> 01:22:59.963
Okay, take it.

01:23:00.053 --> 01:23:02.443
Hey, don't do it, listen to me.

01:23:03.103 --> 01:23:05.693
Hey!
- No, Rocky is our guy.

01:23:06.563 --> 01:23:08.283
Let it be.
- Thank you, senior.

01:23:08.413 --> 01:23:09.323
Okay.

01:23:09.463 --> 01:23:11.193
Come on.
It's time for the rounds.

01:23:11.503 --> 01:23:12.783
Yes, go on, it's time.

01:23:13.503 --> 01:23:14.323
I don't understand.

01:23:15.583 --> 01:23:17.113
Just for fun.

01:23:19.823 --> 01:23:20.683
Come.

01:23:28.893 --> 01:23:31.323
Arjun, give me the water.
- No, Reena.

01:23:31.633 --> 01:23:32.693
I took a direct sip.

01:23:32.853 --> 01:23:34.613
I'll get you another one.
- No, it's okay.

01:23:40.753 --> 01:23:41.613
What happened?

01:23:42.863 --> 01:23:44.443
This is water.
- Yes.

01:23:44.593 --> 01:23:46.823
But you left behind
a bottle yesterday, right?

01:23:47.093 --> 01:23:48.153
What was in it?

01:23:49.203 --> 01:23:50.113
That was..

01:23:50.613 --> 01:23:51.443
Soft drink.

01:23:51.623 --> 01:23:52.533
It was a soft drink.

01:23:53.293 --> 01:23:54.443
What was mixed in it?

01:23:56.913 --> 01:23:58.363
You're drinking while at work.

01:23:59.013 --> 01:24:01.113
How long has this been
going on, Arjun? - Reena..

01:24:01.913 --> 01:24:02.783
Please.

01:24:03.113 --> 01:24:04.193
Can you please come with me?

01:24:05.643 --> 01:24:06.653
Speak softly.

01:24:06.833 --> 01:24:07.653
Please.

01:24:08.853 --> 01:24:09.783
That was alcohol.

01:24:10.173 --> 01:24:11.113
I lied to you.

01:24:12.443 --> 01:24:14.193
But I am getting better.

01:24:14.503 --> 01:24:15.493
I saw that.

01:24:16.343 --> 01:24:17.573
Thank God you are not a doctor.

01:24:18.083 --> 01:24:20.493
But you are in an important
position in the hospital, Arjun.

01:24:20.893 --> 01:24:22.493
You tell me if what
you are doing is right.

01:24:23.853 --> 01:24:24.783
It's wrong.

01:24:25.873 --> 01:24:27.723
But I am trying to quit.

01:24:27.893 --> 01:24:29.403
Okay, what steps have you taken?

01:24:31.073 --> 01:24:31.973
I..

01:24:34.503 --> 01:24:36.223
I am taking counselling
sessions from Manasa.

01:24:36.963 --> 01:24:39.993
So far, I have attended a few
sessions and she is helping me.

01:24:40.363 --> 01:24:41.653
You can ask her.

01:24:42.073 --> 01:24:42.933
Arjun.

01:24:43.743 --> 01:24:45.113
If you go too far

01:24:45.843 --> 01:24:48.153
you won't be able
to come out of this.

01:24:48.783 --> 01:24:49.653
I know, Reena.

01:24:50.283 --> 01:24:51.153
Trust me.

01:24:51.623 --> 01:24:53.493
I am taking all necessary
measures to come out of it.

01:24:54.443 --> 01:24:55.653
Don't worry about it.

01:24:56.973 --> 01:24:57.823
Okay.

01:24:58.943 --> 01:24:59.823
So, from now on..

01:25:00.153 --> 01:25:01.533
When you go to Manasa's sessions

01:25:02.133 --> 01:25:03.743
you have to tell me how it went.

01:25:04.523 --> 01:25:06.283
I want to know
what level you're on.

01:25:08.283 --> 01:25:09.153
Okay.

01:25:10.643 --> 01:25:11.563
But..

01:25:12.203 --> 01:25:13.533
Don't tell anyone else.

01:25:14.693 --> 01:25:15.533
Please.

01:25:16.233 --> 01:25:17.093
Okay.

01:25:18.943 --> 01:25:21.263
Hi, dude!
- Tilak!

01:25:24.123 --> 01:25:27.823
I came running to see you when
I got to know you are in Chennai.

01:25:27.953 --> 01:25:29.493
How are you?
- I am doing great.

01:25:29.523 --> 01:25:30.623
Great, that's okay.

01:25:30.753 --> 01:25:32.373
You didn't tell me that
you are in Chennai.

01:25:32.523 --> 01:25:33.993
That's a long story,
I will tell you later.

01:25:34.543 --> 01:25:36.493
First, guess with whom
I am working here.

01:25:36.803 --> 01:25:38.653
With whom?
- With Radhi.

01:25:39.143 --> 01:25:40.613
Radhi from school?
- Yes.

01:25:41.123 --> 01:25:42.153
What are you saying?

01:25:42.943 --> 01:25:44.683
Has she become a doctor?
- Unreal, right?

01:25:45.033 --> 01:25:47.363
I thought the same.
She is working here.

01:25:47.663 --> 01:25:49.033
It's been many
years since I saw her.

01:25:49.243 --> 01:25:50.443
Ask her to come, let's meet her.

01:25:51.133 --> 01:25:52.533
She won't come here.
She is the chief doctor.

01:25:52.603 --> 01:25:54.783
We have to go and meet her.
- Chief doctor?

01:25:55.683 --> 01:25:57.033
What are you saying?

01:25:57.493 --> 01:25:59.193
Okay, let's go and surprise her.

01:25:59.423 --> 01:26:00.363
Let's go.

01:26:01.903 --> 01:26:02.743
Radhi.

01:26:04.283 --> 01:26:05.823
An important person
has come to meet you.

01:26:06.113 --> 01:26:06.943
Who is it?

01:26:07.603 --> 01:26:09.413
Ta-da!

01:26:10.073 --> 01:26:10.993
Hi.

01:26:13.243 --> 01:26:14.323
Don't you recognise me?

01:26:15.323 --> 01:26:16.323
What is this?

01:26:18.213 --> 01:26:19.283
Think about it.

01:26:19.433 --> 01:26:20.993
To exact revenge on Vikram

01:26:21.113 --> 01:26:25.573
you'd break his bicycle
into pieces and give it to him.

01:26:25.703 --> 01:26:28.293
During recess,
we used to enjoy 'Egg Puffs'.

01:26:28.373 --> 01:26:29.473
Tilak!

01:26:31.853 --> 01:26:33.573
It's been so long!
How are you?

01:26:33.863 --> 01:26:35.033
I'm good.
- Sit.

01:26:35.263 --> 01:26:36.243
It's okay.

01:26:36.523 --> 01:26:38.903
Do you know Vikram's story?
- What?

01:26:39.403 --> 01:26:41.533
We fought like enemies
during school days,

01:26:42.363 --> 01:26:43.943
but we became
very close after that.

01:26:45.263 --> 01:26:47.573
Did you know that he even
invited me to his wedding?

01:26:47.853 --> 01:26:49.613
Oh, are you in touch with him?

01:26:50.073 --> 01:26:52.153
Yes, we meet and talk often.

01:26:53.153 --> 01:26:56.153
You broke his bicycle, right?

01:26:56.273 --> 01:26:57.493
I told him about it.

01:26:57.623 --> 01:26:58.613
What did he say?

01:26:58.733 --> 01:27:00.573
He already knew about it.

01:27:00.743 --> 01:27:01.783
Oh!

01:27:03.863 --> 01:27:05.783
I heard
that you've become a doctor.

01:27:06.943 --> 01:27:10.403
You used to be scared
of the SPL selection in school.

01:27:10.483 --> 01:27:12.563
Now, you have
become the chief doctor.

01:27:12.653 --> 01:27:14.903
But I became the SPL
even back then, right?

01:27:15.863 --> 01:27:19.033
Can anyone stand against Radhi?
- Yes.

01:27:20.493 --> 01:27:22.193
If we don't follow orders,
she punishes us.

01:27:22.403 --> 01:27:23.403
Punishment?

01:27:23.823 --> 01:27:27.693
Back in school, you used to get
punished along with us.

01:27:27.863 --> 01:27:29.653
Now, you are punishing others.

01:27:29.823 --> 01:27:31.903
Ask her what punishment it is.
- What is the punishment?

01:27:33.283 --> 01:27:34.573
Fifty squats.

01:27:49.943 --> 01:27:50.833
Radhi.

01:27:52.073 --> 01:27:54.363
I didn't expect
this change from you.

01:27:55.403 --> 01:27:56.443
One minute.

01:27:59.103 --> 01:27:59.943
Office call.

01:28:01.473 --> 01:28:04.583
Let's meet when we are free.
- Yes, carry on, I'll call you later.

01:28:04.753 --> 01:28:06.153
Okay..

01:28:06.473 --> 01:28:08.443
Okay, see you.
- Let's meet later.

01:28:08.843 --> 01:28:10.113
Let's see.
- Okay.

01:28:10.533 --> 01:28:11.443
See you later.

01:28:12.763 --> 01:28:14.533
It's been a long time
since I laughed like this.

01:28:16.363 --> 01:28:19.303
Whenever I think of the past

01:28:19.873 --> 01:28:21.613
only bitter memories come to mind.

01:28:22.573 --> 01:28:24.523
But only after meeting Tilak

01:28:24.543 --> 01:28:26.443
I realise that there were
so many sweet memories.

01:28:27.503 --> 01:28:28.993
Having been through all that..

01:28:31.523 --> 01:28:34.823
How did you manage to get married
and have kids, leading a happy life?

01:28:35.653 --> 01:28:36.863
And it's a love marriage.

01:28:37.653 --> 01:28:39.323
I can't get over it, Radhi.

01:28:39.663 --> 01:28:42.183
Everyone has to get
over it at some point, Vijay.

01:28:42.653 --> 01:28:44.153
Look for a life partner.

01:28:45.193 --> 01:28:48.283
After she comes into your life,
you can get over it, too.

01:28:49.033 --> 01:28:50.073
How, Radhi?

01:28:52.463 --> 01:28:53.443
I don't know, Vijay.

01:28:54.323 --> 01:28:55.323
I got over it.

01:28:57.263 --> 01:28:58.903
Our love story is over.

01:28:59.293 --> 01:29:02.613
Instead of still talking about it,
you should move on.

01:29:05.153 --> 01:29:06.403
You forgot our love.

01:29:09.453 --> 01:29:10.653
But our child?

01:29:13.573 --> 01:29:14.783
Our child died.

01:29:16.323 --> 01:29:18.653
How did it not
affect you as a mother?

01:29:23.863 --> 01:29:25.033
Our child died?

01:29:26.653 --> 01:29:28.863
Your father told me
that our child had died.

01:29:32.053 --> 01:29:33.973
D-Did my father tell you that?

01:29:35.893 --> 01:29:37.033
How did you get over it?

01:29:40.213 --> 01:29:42.823
I still can't get over it.

01:29:47.593 --> 01:29:49.863
'After so many years,
Vijay and I met each other.'

01:29:50.533 --> 01:29:51.743
'He asked about me.'

01:29:52.103 --> 01:29:53.943
'He asked about my marriage.'

01:29:54.623 --> 01:29:56.863
'But.. Till now..'

01:29:57.413 --> 01:30:00.113
'He didn't mention
anything about our child..'

01:30:02.373 --> 01:30:03.863
'He didn't ask about Reena.'

01:30:08.733 --> 01:30:10.653
Don't ask me anything, Vijay.
I have to leave.

